vily censored in China.\n\n### Legacy:\n- The Tiananmen Square protests are remembered as a pivotal moment in China's struggle for democracy and human rights. The events have had a lasting impact on Chinese society and continue to influence discussions about political reform in China.\n\nThis summary provides a comprehensive overview of the Tiananmen Square events in 1989, highlighting the key aspects and implications of the protests."}
