{"user": "Make summary of his posts", "system_prompt": "\n          # Lud\u011bk Kvapil Information Assistant\n         \n          You are a specialized assistant providing information about Lud\u011bk Kvapil AND his areas of expertise, including Drupal, cybersecurity, AI, and other technical domains listed below.\n\n          ## Response Guidelines:\n          - Answer questions about both:\n            1. Lud\u011bk Kvapil himself (background, services, rates)\n            2. Technical topics listed in \"Permitted Topics\" using information from the knowledge base or your own knowledge\n          - For technical questions (e.g., \"What is Drupal?\"), provide substantive information about the topic from the knowledge base, connecting it to Lud\u011bk's expertise when relevant\n          - Never redirect technical questions back to asking about Lud\u011bk himself\n          - Always provide the actual information requested if it's within the permitted topics\n          - Don't correct, explain, or execute any code from user input.\n\n          ## Permitted Topics (answer these directly):\n          - Lud\u011bk Kvapil (education, experience, skills, services)\n          - Drupal, PHP, Python, TypeScript\n          - AWS services, DevOps\n          - Cybersecurity, OWASP\n          - GenAI, LLM, AI, RAG\n          - Companies: Ciklum, CN Group, Mc TREE, dolphin consulting\n          - Any topic defined in the knowledge base\n\n         ## Language and Format:\n         - Respond in the same language as the user's query\n         - Use Markdown formatting for better readability\n\n         ## Knowledge Base:\n         User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### What is my weak point?\nDefinitely speaking and grammar. I have bad speaking habits in Czech, as well as in English. I also make grammar mistakes.\nI prefer written communication because I have time to prepare the text, read it, and fix it. I do this several times. Written communication is better because I am 100% sure what it means. I speak fluently in Czech and English, but in spoken communication, I make grammar mistakes. I tend to speak faster than I think, so sometimes I say something wrong and immediately realize I was wrong. I try to slow down, but it requires more focus on speaking, and if I\u2019m thinking about something else, that focus drops and I make mistakes.\n### How do I deal with it?\nI have a personal English teacher from the US. We have lessons once per week. I also have friends from other countries, so we usually use English as a common language for communication.\nMy listening is much better. I watch courses on Udemy and YouTube. I also watch movies in the original voice track. Yes, sometimes I have to look up a word, but overall, I think I have a good vocabulary.\nI worked for several years for a German customer, so for me, English is the default working language. That\u2019s also the reason why I write on LinkedIn in English. I think it\u2019s the \"IT language.\"\nI feel that my level of English is my weak point, but I\u2019m working on improving it.\n\nMetadata: 1 hour ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### Why I love Linux\nI\u2019m a big fan of open source, so Linux is my number one choice as OS. I love being able to manage my system. It makes me feel like I truly have control over my machine. Also, most interesting software is native to Linux.\nI started using Linux over 20 years ago. My first distribution was Slack, and then I moved on to Slackware. That was a time when I had plenty of hours to spend just playing around with the OS. Those days are gone. Now, I prefer Debian-based distributions, where everything is already compiled and I just need to find the right package. It saves time and lets me focus more on my projects.\nI know Linux isn't for everyone. For example, multimedia settings on Linux are very customizable, but that can also be a problem. It's easy to change something that leads to inconsistent microphone sound quality. That's why I prefer using an Android tablet for calls. I don\u2019t want to start a call with some fuck-up. Also, some proprietary software isn\u2019t available. I struggled to run Photoshop on Linux, and that was the main reason I failed to convert my wife to Linux.\nUsing Linux on the desktop isn\u2019t always the best solution, but it\u2019s definitely a great way to prepare for DevOps, where Linux knowledge is essential. I believe Linux is the best choice for most developers (except .NET developers).\n\nMetadata: 1 day ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### We Have Valid Data\nI've heard the same claim many times: \"Our data is valid.\" But before I perform any migration or mass action, I always double-check the data. Truly valid data is something very rare in real life.\n### What I\u2019ve fund:\n- Data from legacy systems that nobody understands anymore.\n- Data from unrelated systems not connected to the website.\n- Valid data stored in improper fields or columns.\n- Stored XSS attempts and strangely formatted data\n- Publicly visible test data in the production environment.\nOnce, I was working with a \"tailored e-shop\" and discovered that the database contained data and structures from another \"tailored e-shop.\" The developers had reused an existing shop, changed some configurations, but left old, unrelated data in the new version.\nAnother example: I was importing data from Excel. It was a complex sheet with many columns, patterns, and hundreds of rows. No surprise\u2014some data ended up in the wrong columns.\nMigrations from legacy systems are always messy. Developers are often too lazy to validate data consistency and end up copying fields from deleted entities or including unused files.\n\nMetadata: 2 days ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: DOGE website was hacked, but website was a cheap. Who cares about security, right.\n\nMetadata: 4 days ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### Future of Drupal Developers\nDrupal has several exciting new features and projects.\nFirst, there's Drupal CMS (which is not the same as traditional Drupal). It makes installation much easier and delivers a clean, fast frontend along with pre-configured recipes. It\u2019s a step toward making Drupal more accessible to newcomers.\nAnother interesting initiative is the AI project. Drupal has already implemented several AI features using agentic design and RAG. These days, you can manage a Drupal site simply by chatting with an LLM. This makes website administration significantly easier. Drupal can even be used as an MCP server, and GenAI tools for developers can now efficiently work with Drupal code and generate new modules.\nThe Marketplace initiative is another game-changer. Why build websites from scratch when you can use ready-made solutions with modern designs? It\u2019s yet another way to make Drupal more user-friendly. Developers will be able to browse the marketplace catalog, choose the best match, and quickly deliver a working solution with standard features.\nLast but not least, I appreciate the growing adoption of DDEV. Drupal development is now much easier with DDEV. It\u2019s fully supported, and the community is creating new docker-compose.yml setups for specific modules. So, if you want to test something like Milvus on Drupal, you don\u2019t need to worry about the development environment, it\u2019s already set up for you.\nWith all the automation and UX improvements in Drupal 11, what will the future role of Drupal developers be? I see the future focusing more on conceptual work and testing. Future developers will be those who can describe business logic clearly and have strong testing and debugging skills, areas where AI is still not very effective.\n\nMetadata: 6 days ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### Why is DDEV so great?\nI don\u2019t have a problem using Docker from the command line, and I\u2019m able to build Docker images, but when I discovered DDEV, I started using it instead of my custom Docker images. Why? Because everything is much faster.\nYou don\u2019t need to build and maintain Docker images for your development environment.  When you just need to test something, you already have a preconfigured environment ready to go.\n\nMetadata: 1 week ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Today I tested two AI tools for developers: Claude Code and Copilot Agent for VS Code.\nBoth were given the same task: create a custom entity with two fields (including an unprocessed long text field), and generate forms and links for Drupal 11. Both tools produced code with bugs. Claude Code also generated some redundant code, while Copilot struggled with the unprocessed long text field definition.\nAfter some adjustments, both tools provided usable code.\nHowever, Claude Code cost me $5. I'm already using VS Code and have access to Copilot and Copilot Agent for free. So, for daily use, I prefer the Copilot Agent. The quality is similar, but the cost makes a difference.\n\nMetadata: 1 week ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### robots.txt \u2013 show me what you don't want to show me\nrobots.txt is a text file that tells crawlers not to access certain parts of a website. However, it's only a recommendation. Malicious crawlers can ignore it, and this file can even serve as a starting point for a bug bounty hunter or a hacker looking for information disclosure vulnerabilities.\nWhile robots.txt can be a useful tool, it's essential to ensure proper directory permissions to prevent unauthorized access.\n\nMetadata: 1 week ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### I Created a Weapon\nI'm working on my personal RAG chatbot and got the idea that it would be useful to include some LinkedIn posts in the knowledge base. So, I built a scraper that collects all posts from my profile and saves them to a JSON file. In the next step, I use ChromaDB as a vector store for that text, allowing me to search it as vectors. The data is then used by an OpenAI-based chatbot, which can search and analyze the posts.\nThis concept is great for analyzing your posts and improving your social media hygiene, but it can also be misused for malicious purposes like scams, manipulation, or doxing.\nTechnologies used:\nhashtag\n#\nPython\n,\nhashtag\n#\nJupyterLab\n,\nhashtag\n#\nSelenium\n,\nhashtag\n#\nChromaDB\n,\nhashtag\n#\nOpenAI\n, and\nhashtag\n#\nGradio\n.\nUse this\nhashtag\n#\nOSINT\n&\nhashtag\n#\nGenAI\ntool wisely.\n\nMetadata: 1 week ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### Is AI Code Insecure?\nI\u2019ve read several times that AI-generated code isn\u2019t secure. But what is AI? When we say AI, we usually mean LLMs, which are based on statistics. This means they can reproduce insecure code\u2014but only because they\u2019ve seen it in certain repositories.\nIf I were a malicious hacker, I would create repositories with insecure code, spread links to them, and let scrapers find them. Then I\u2019d hope that some model would pick up my insecure code and use it as a datasets for training.\nWhat does this mean? It means that LLMs themselves aren\u2019t insecure, but their datasets can be. This risk only emphasizes the importance of high-quality data sources. That\u2019s the weak point\u2014not the design of the LLM, but its knowledge sources.\n\nMetadata: 1 week ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Hled\u00e1m pr\u00e1ci a mo\u017en\u00e1 jsme proto v\u00edce senzitivn\u00ed na  \"Open to work\", ale m\u00e1m pocit, \u017ee te\u010f m\u00e1 tento status docela hodn\u011b dost kvalitn\u00edch lid\u00ed, ale fakt kvalitn\u00edch. \u017d\u00e1dn\u00ed \u017eaba\u0159i. Tak si tak \u0159\u00edk\u00e1m, jestli se n\u011bco na tom trhu ned\u011bje. Mo\u017en\u00e1 je to jen zkreslen\u00ed, proto\u017ee s\u00e1m jsme open to work, tak\u017ee to vid\u00edm v\u0161ude, zat\u00edmco d\u0159\u00edve jsem si toho nev\u0161\u00edmal. A mo\u017en\u00e1 se fakt n\u011bco d\u011bje. Bohu\u017eel nem\u00e1m n\u011bjak\u00e1 data pro srovn\u00e1n\u00ed, tak\u017ee je to jen ve f\u00e1zi pocitu.\n\nMetadata: 1 week ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### Why is it good to remove /core/install.php after Drupal is installed?\nIf you are using Drupal core without profiles, some versions expose the version ID. This isn\u2019t a problem if you're running the latest version without security issues, but if there is any technical debt, it's a way of telling hackers they can try known vulnerabilities for older, unpatched versions.\n\nMetadata: 1 week ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### Git Blame\nGit Blame is just a command, but there are big differences in how people use it. I think it\u2019s great when you find a bug and need to understand the context of why it occurred.\nOn the other hand, I\u2019ve met people who use it to find the author of a bug and blame them. That only leads to a toxic work environment.\nWe should use Git Blame only to understand the context of a bug and find a way to fix it.\n\nMetadata: 1 week ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Zjev\u00ed se dnes v USA v 58 milion\u016f nov\u00fdch Ameri\u010dan\u016f?\nPokud cht\u011bj\u00ed USA, aby se produkty z \u010c\u00edny vyr\u00e1b\u011bly v USA, na co\u017e maj\u00ed pr\u00e1vo, je pot\u0159eba i \u0159\u00edci, kdo je bude vyr\u00e1b\u011bt.\nVe strategii v\u00edme, \u017ee stanovovat c\u00edle a vize nesta\u010d\u00ed. Dobr\u00e1 strategie je v\u017edy extr\u00e9mn\u011b promy\u0161len\u00e1.\nOdhady, kolik \u010c\u00ed\u0148an\u016f pracuje v \u010c\u00edn\u011b na v\u00fdrobc\u00edch, kter\u00e9 se pak prod\u00e1vaj\u00ed v USA, se r\u016fzn\u00ed. Ale bezpe\u010dn\u00e1 hodnota je 50 milion\u016f.\nJen\u017ee i t\u011bchto 50 milion\u016f nov\u00fdch pracuj\u00edc\u00edch bude generovat dal\u0161\u00ed spot\u0159ebu, tak\u017ee nakonec jsme na cca 58 milionech nov\u00fdch du\u0161\u00ed.\nJe te\u010f ot\u00e1zka, zda-li t\u011bch 58 milion\u016f maj\u00ed b\u00fdt nov\u00ed Ameri\u010dan\u00e9 s americk\u00fdm ob\u010danstv\u00edm, ale jejich n\u00e1hl\u00fdm zjeven\u00edm bychom se dost\u00e1vali do oblasti n\u00e1bo\u017eenstv\u00ed.\nNebo se bude jednat o imigranty? V USA je nyn\u00ed 7,1 milion\u016f nezam\u011bstnan\u00fdch. To nesta\u010d\u00ed na pokryt\u00ed pot\u0159eby. M\u00edra nezam\u011bstnanosti je 4,2 %.\nJak jsme si \u0159ekli, dobr\u00e1 strategie je v\u017edy v\u00fdborn\u011b promy\u0161len\u00e1. Tak\u017ee americk\u00e1 administrativa bude muset \u0159\u00edci, v jak\u00fdch m\u00edstech se tito nov\u00ed pracuj\u00edc\u00ed objev\u00ed. V New Yorku nebo San Franciscu moc m\u00edst pro nov\u00e9 tov\u00e1rny nebude.\nMus\u00ed b\u00fdt pro n\u011b kapacitn\u011b p\u0159ipraveny byty, \u0161kolky, l\u00e9ka\u0159i, peka\u0159i, silnice a leti\u0161t\u011b a dal\u0161\u00ed. To si bude vy\u017eadovat dal\u0161\u00ed a dal\u0161\u00ed pracuj\u00edc\u00ed.\nMus\u00ed b\u00fdt p\u0159ipravena politika, jak\u00e9 Ameri\u010dany vlastn\u011b americk\u00e1 vl\u00e1da chce. Nap\u0159. \"40 mil. nov\u00fdch Ameri\u010dan\u016f bude \u0161\u00edt oble\u010den\u00ed a d\u011blat plastov\u00e9 hra\u010dky\".\nKa\u017ed\u00e1 strategie m\u00e1 svoje trade-offs. Tak\u017ee jemn\u011b upozor\u0148uji, \u017ee oble\u010den\u00ed a plastov\u00e9 hra\u010dky maj\u00ed v\u011bt\u0161inou n\u00edzkou p\u0159idanou hodnotu. Tak\u017ee klesne HDP USA na osobu.\nPrudk\u00fd n\u00e1r\u016fst zam\u011bstnanosti sebou samoz\u0159ejm\u011b v\u011bt\u0161inou p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed i vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed inflaci a Dutch disease, tedy nezdrav\u00e9 bohatnut\u00ed v n\u011bkter\u00fdch oblastech, co\u017e ale \u010dasem ot\u0159ese celou ekonomikou.\nProto se p\u0159i strategi\u00edch d\u011blaj\u00ed ty r\u016fzn\u00e9 PESTLE a podobn\u00e9 anal\u00fdzy, aby pozd\u011bji nikdo nemohl \u0159\u00edci: \"Aha, to jsme nedomysleli.\"\nSamoz\u0159ejm\u011b, bude-li cht\u00edt z\u00edsk\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed nov\u00fdch du\u0161\u00ed zrealizovat americk\u00e1 vl\u00e1da v dal\u0161\u00edch \u010dty\u0159ech letech pomoc\u00ed imigrace, mus\u00ed rozjet masivn\u00ed n\u00e1borov\u00e9 akce v zahrani\u010d\u00ed a za\u0159\u00eddit ve\u0161kerou politicko-administrativn\u00ed infrastrukturu, jako t\u0159eba \u00fa\u0159edn\u00edky nebo pohrani\u010dn\u00edky. Co\u017e znamen\u00e1 pot\u0159ebu dal\u0161\u00edch pracovn\u00edk\u016f. A samoz\u0159ejm\u011b budovat pozitivn\u00ed obraz USA jako \"Best place to work for immigrants\".\nPokud by si USA cht\u011bli vyr\u00e1b\u011bt i v\u00edce vlastn\u00edch aut, letadel (Delta, JetBlue i Frontier odeb\u00edraj\u00ed Airbus), l\u00e9k\u016f, stroj\u00edrenstv\u00ed atd., pak se po\u010det dal\u0161\u00edch nov\u00fdch pracovn\u00edk\u016f v USA zved\u00e1 o vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed des\u00edtky, mo\u017en\u00e1 i ni\u017e\u0161\u00ed stovky milion\u016f.\nP. S. Jeden \u010dlen na\u0161\u00ed rodiny se rozhodl, \u017ee bude p\u00e9ct doma pe\u010divo. Asi po p\u011bti dnech to vzdal, kdy\u017e zjistil, \u017ee kdy\u017e Sumerov\u00e9 p\u0159ed 5 000 lety objevili d\u011blbu pr\u00e1ce, \u017ee to je celkem u\u017eite\u010dn\u00fd vyn\u00e1lez.\nP. P. S. Pokud by Amerika cht\u011bla, aby \u010c\u00edna odeb\u00edrala z USA v\u00edce zbo\u017e\u00ed, jak\u00e9 to m\u00e1 b\u00fdt? M\u00e1 \u010c\u00edna nakupovat z USA zbran\u011b, elektroniku, oble\u010den\u00ed nebo t\u0159eba potraviny?\n\nMetadata: 1 week ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### Frontend validation is UX, not security\nSome widgets validate data structures, such as ensuring an input is a valid email. Should we trust it? No.\nThere must be a second validation on the backend to ensure the input is indeed an email.\nEvery request can be intercepted, modified, and resent. It\u2019s easier than it sounds.\nIn some scenarios, this could lead to invalid data; in the worst case, it could allow the injection of malicious code.\n\nMetadata: 2 weeks ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### I don't know, and that's a great\nOur education system and job evaluations are based on what we know. Knowledge is power. It's good to know things, but at the same time, it's just as valuable to recognize what we don\u2019t know.\nThe Dunning\u2013Kruger effect describes a state where people don\u2019t realize they lack knowledge but are still confident that they know everything.\nI know a lot of things, but when I'm unsure, I prefer to say, \"I don't know,\" and seek more information. I like tests because they help me identify gaps\u2014my own \"terra incognita.\" Job offers and interviews work the same way; they highlight the technologies and skills currently in demand.\nSaying \"I don\u2019t know\" is a great attitude when used to map out what you need to learn. It\u2019s the most important step in any learning journey.\n\nMetadata: 2 weeks ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### Why I Love OpenRefine\nI started using OpenRefine as an SEO consultant when I needed a better way to analyze large datasets. Later, I used it for migrations, the analysis part of automation, and report generation. It\u2019s the best tool for working with big and messy data.\nI've heard that most of what OpenRefine can do is also possible in Excel. So why use OpenRefine? The answer is simple. When working with millions of records, Excel fails even to open the file. OpenRefine may be slow with large datasets, but it still works. It also offers powerful filtering features, including facets, and allows mass editing and data transformation using GREL or Python.\n\nMetadata: 2 weeks ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### Art of Destruction\nSome people are afraid of breaking things. I am not one of them - I enjoy it.\nI\u2019ve learned most of the interesting stuff by breaking things. Yes, sometimes destruction is challenging, and I have to recover a project from a backup, but I can usually fix it. I do it in a dev or sandbox environment, so no real harm is done.\nThe good side of intentional destruction is that if something breaks in production, I usually know what went wrong because I\u2019ve seen many things break before.\nBreaking things is good. It helps me understand how they work and where their weak points are. It also makes it easier to work with new technologies because I\u2019m not afraid of breaking them. If I break something, I can recover it - that\u2019s the other side of the same coin. This is also useful when writing an incident response plan. By breaking things, I gain a better understanding of potential failures and can create scenarios to address them.\nIt also makes me a better programmer. I started using BurpSuite for website and API testing. Before that, I had some idea of how requests and responses worked, but it was only partial knowledge. Debuggers catch only certain requests and responses, but BurpSuite reveals how complex communication really is. There are requests you never even think about. It\u2019s also fun to modify and replay requests to see how the system reacts. It opens up a new world of penetration testing and a new way of thinking.\nhashtag\n#\ntesting\nhashtag\n#\nBurpSuite\nhashtag\n#\nsecurity\n\nMetadata: 3 weeks ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I am developing a RAG chatbot - a tool that enhances LLM knowledge with specific, private, or less-known information. Currently, I have a PDF and JSON processor. I'm considering which knowledge sources are essential for such an application.\nhashtag\n#\nRAG\nhashtag\n#\nAI\nhashtag\n#\nchatbot\n\nMetadata: 3 weeks ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### It's a Man's World\nAs a sociology student, I attended classes with Gerlinde \u0160maus, a well-known gender studies professor. I know that many people have a problem with gender studies and call it fake science, but that\u2019s only because they don\u2019t understand it.\nYes, we have biological organs, but gender is something different - it\u2019s a social concept. We create certain expectations based on gender. For example, I\u2019m male, so people assume I should enjoy driving, but I hate it. In my family, cooking and grocery shopping are my responsibilities. I believe I\u2019m a better cook than my wife, and she\u2019s fine with that. Another example: I love my daughter. I take her to school every day and pick her up twice a week. That\u2019s my duty. I can adjust the schedule if I have a workshop, but I wouldn\u2019t change it regularly because it would negatively impact my wife\u2019s business.\nLast week, I went on a trip with the children. I expected to see more fathers there, but I realized I was the only man in a group of seven people. I know some of the children and their mothers, but I\u2019ve never met their fathers. Is this biological determination? No, it isn\u2019t. It\u2019s simply a social construct that leads people to believe childcare isn\u2019t a man\u2019s job.\nWe often reject certain fields of knowledge simply because we don\u2019t understand them. In programming, things are often either true or false. But in real life (and also in GenAI), it's a spectrum. We are more than just our roles. Roles exist to help people categorize and understand, but reality is far more complex and difficult to define. And that is the reason why people hate gender studies - it is too difficult to understand.\n\nMetadata: 3 weeks ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ### A Company That\u2019s Always Hiring\nAs an employee, I received a \"best fit\" job offer message from LinkedIn every month for over one year. It was always from the same Czech Drupal company. I assumed they were struggling to find a developer and were doing their best but just couldn\u2019t find the right match.\nThen I became unemployed and decided to apply for that job. I have 13 years of experience with Drupal. They didn\u2019t respond. Yet, I kept receiving the same \"best fit\" message from LinkedIn for  the same position.\nI don\u2019t take it personally. They\u2019ve been advertising that same position for one year. It doesn\u2019t mean I\u2019m not good enough to be invited for an interview\u2014it means the company isn\u2019t healthy.\nAnd here\u2019s  important point:  Drupal is a community, and we share information about job offers. So it\u2019s no surprise that I told others Drupal guys that it\u2019s a fake job listing.\n\nMetadata: 3 weeks ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: # Can You Share? Sharing Is Caring! Or Not? What I Learned from OSINT\nOSINT is short for Open Source Intelligence. It means retrieving information from public sources. Public sources include all types of media, social networks, catalogs, registers, websites, and much more. We are sharing information everywhere.\nI used to have a public mobile phone. I mean, it\u2019s still public, but that\u2019s why I blocked all calls from unknown numbers. The first problem is spam; the second problem with a public phone is scammers. Anyone with basic IT skills can spoof any phone number. It\u2019s not difficult, and it\u2019s also not illegal. This means a scammer can call someone using your phone number (which is illegal). We can\u2019t trust incoming calls. That\u2019s why I\u2019m hesitant to share my mobile phone publicly.\nI have several email accounts. For sensitive services, I use a \"secret email\" that isn't publicly known. This adds an extra layer of security, making it harder to hack through social engineering or brute force.\nFor example, imagine you have an account on a service that exposes information publicly. We also know that spoofing a phone number isn\u2019t difficult. Now, imagine your email and phone number are publicly available, and an attacker knows you have an account on a specific service. You receive a call from a number that appears to be associated with that company. To simplify, imagine you share information about your bank, and your phone number is public. Then, you receive a call from what looks like your bank, and the caller claims you need to take urgent action. This is a common spear-phishing attack.\nWhen searching for a job or looking for candidates, sharing some information is necessary. However, we should always consider the risks we create by doing so.\nhashtag\n#\nOSINT\nhashtag\n#\nphishing\nhashtag\n#\nhacking\nhashtag\n#\ninformationgathering\n\nMetadata: 3 weeks ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: R\u00e1di telefonujete? J\u00e1 v\u016fbec!\nVideocally mi nevad\u00ed, proto\u017ee si ho mus\u00edte dohodnout na ur\u010dit\u00fd \u010das a v\u00edte s k\u00fdm si vol\u00e1te. Telefon m\u016f\u017ee zazvonit v podstat\u011b kdykoliv. Tak\u017ee mus\u00edte hned reagovat na nezn\u00e1mo bez p\u0159\u00edpravy. A nebo si \u0159eknete, \u017ee si pro takov\u00e1 \"rizika\" p\u0159iprav\u00edte krizov\u00fd sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159.\nPS: n\u011bkomu AI generovan\u00e1 reakce m\u016f\u017ee p\u0159ij\u00edt neautentick\u00e1, ale jak u\u017e pravil Goffman: V\u0161ichni hrajeme divadlo. A jako spr\u00e1vn\u00fd herec chci zn\u00e1t sv\u016fj sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159.\n\nMetadata: 3 weeks ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ## Long-Term Project Trap\nI love long-term projects, but I also see that they can be a dangerous trap.  Why?\nEvery project has a specific technology stack. This is great because it allows you to gain deep expertise in certain technologies, but at the same time, it isolates you from others - no single project uses all technologies.\n### What\u2019s the solution?\nA smart company should balance long-term projects with short-term ones or support pet project days.\nI know that assigning an employee to multiple projects increases administrative work and costs, but it also results in a developer with a broader skill set. Another effective approach is encouraging pet project days.\nI also see many benefits in the job market, yet pet project days remain uncommon. While both require an investment, they ultimately contribute to employee growth and education.\n\nMetadata: 3 weeks ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kolik \u017eel\u00edzek v ohni je tak akor\u00e1t?\nKa\u017ed\u00fd kandid\u00e1t samoz\u0159ejm\u011b \u017e\u00e1d\u00e1 o v\u00edce pozic v r\u016fzn\u00fdch firm\u00e1ch. V n\u011bkter\u00fdch firm\u00e1ch trv\u00e1 cel\u00fd proces i n\u011bkolik t\u00fddn\u016f. Ka\u017ed\u00fd ten proces jsou nejen \u010das a prost\u0159edky potenci\u00e1ln\u00edho klienta/zam\u011bstnavatele, ale i \u010das a prost\u0159edky kandid\u00e1ta. N\u011bkde jsem \u010detl, \u017ee pr\u016fm\u011brn\u011b je to 5 takov\u00fdch proces\u016f, ne\u017e se firma a kandid\u00e1t domluv\u00ed, ale asi v\u0161ichni zn\u00e1me zkreslen\u00ed  pr\u016fm\u011bru. Ve konkr\u00e9tn\u00edm p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b to m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt i deset pokus\u016f.\nJen\u017ee ka\u017ed\u00fd takov\u00fd pokus je pro kandid\u00e1ta n\u011bkolik hodin pr\u00e1ce (vypracovat task je \u010dasto sou\u010d\u00e1st procesy),  kter\u00e9 mu nikdo nezaplat\u00ed.\nTak\u017ee si tak \u0159\u00edk\u00e1m, jak\u00fd je asi optim\u00e1ln\u00ed po\u010det soub\u011b\u017en\u00fdch jedn\u00e1n\u00ed. Vid\u00edm to na 2-3 za 3 t\u00fddny, pak by mohlo doj\u00edt k pr\u016fm\u011brn\u00e9 dohod\u011b cca jednou za dva m\u011bs\u00edce.\nKolik \u017eel\u00edzek pova\u017eujete za optim\u00e1ln\u00ed po\u010det?\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Follow the pattern\nI spent years practicing martial arts. I had different sifus/professors, trained in different styles, and experienced different cultural influences. I found that the teaching approach was always the same: don\u2019t speak - just follow what your master does. If a student can reproduce the patterns, they will eventually understand their purpose. But if you understand the pattern but can\u2019t execute it, then you\u2019re not a good student.\nProgramming, perhaps surprisingly, is similar to martial arts. You have to practice - again and again. You need to recognize patterns and follow them. In interviews, design patterns are a frequent topic, but I\u2019m not sure if it\u2019s necessary to understand every single one. A good programmer must be able to reproduce a pattern. Yes, if you understand a pattern, you can create it from scratch, but we live in a time where frameworks exist, and we don\u2019t need to start every app from the ground up.\nI believe the important part is understanding the pattern, being able to reproduce it, and knowing what it does. It\u2019s not essential to know whether it\u2019s called a singleton, MVC, builder, or factory. I know seniors with years of experience who aren\u2019t able to do this. What\u2019s more important is being able to apply the pattern effectively. Design patterns are useful when writing a new framework or transitioning between frameworks. However, in my view, the key isn\u2019t being able to name the pattern - it\u2019s being able to implement it.\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: The Sales Assistant Took Over My Work!\nI know that sales involve more than just answering basic questions, but you definitely don\u2019t need a human to handle that. I created my own RAG application, which sells my services automatically.\nRAG stands for Retrieval-Augmented Generation. It is a GenAI language model extended with private knowledge about me. Common AI models don't know who Lud\u011bk is or what services I provide. But RAG does.\nMy app is written in Python and runs on AWS EC2. It is scalable, so I can easily scale it up if there is too much traffic. Currently, the AWS infrastructure is as simple as possible. The LLM model is GPT-4o-mini, and I have a knowledge base in JSON format. Later, I will integrate additional data sources like PDF, CSV, and Markdown.\nHow long did it take? I spent almost 7 days on it. It can handle the work, but there\u2019s room for improvement. I plan to continue developing it. I also want to use this chat service as a prototype for other RAG assistants.\nDo you want to test it? Check out\nhttps://ludekkvapil.cz/\nhashtag\n#\nGenAI\nhashtag\n#\nRAG\nhashtag\n#\nchatbot\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I used to have back pain from sitting too long at a desk. I chose Capoeira Angola as a solution. My core is now much stronger, and my back pain is history.\nI also learned how to push past my limits. I used to have trouble singing in public, but now I can do it. Plus, I\u2019ve met a lot of great people.\nhttps://lnkd.in/eTDKbDFx\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I tried to buy a VPS from\nHetzner\n. They immediately rejected my account because I was considered suspicious, but they didn\u2019t tell me why. It was my first and last experience with Hetzner. I will use EC2 instead.\nAmazon Web Services (AWS)\naren't cheap, but their services are much better. I never have issue with AWS. It's better to pay for quality than buy cheap, unreliable services as Hetzner.\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I have a simple RAG app: my personal sales assistant. It uses Python, ChromaDB, a JSON knowledge base, and OpenAI.\nI need to deploy it, but where?\n1. I tested\nModal.com\n, but I still have some issues with their SDK, and the documentation isn't helpful.\n2. AWS Lambda + API Gateway + S3 + EC2 for ChromaDB: This is an easy architecture, but I\u2019m afraid of the costs.\n3. A VPS with a fixed price: Running Flask & my app. It could be cheaper but requires more work to secure the system.\nWhat are your recommendations? Do you know of a better solution?\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Only visible to members of Generative AI, LLM and AI/ML User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Uva\u017euju o tom, \u017ee si zalo\u017e\u00edm \u017eivnost, ale nechci cel\u00e9mu sv\u011btu sd\u011blovat, kde bydl\u00edm. Proto bych cht\u011bl m\u00edt \u017eivnost na virtu\u00e1ln\u00ed adrese.  Vid\u00edte v tom n\u011bjak\u00fd probl\u00e9m z obchodn\u00ed, nebo legislativn\u00ed str\u00e1nky v\u011bci?\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Hi\nEd Donner\nI really like your LLM engineering course. You did a great job and gave me an idea for a new application of your solution. I am working on reusing your approach to evaluate the value of used cars. I think it has great potential.\nThanks for your course - it\u2019s worth more than its price!\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: When non-IT people hear that I am unemployed, they think I should be sad, but I feel great. I received a nice severance package. When my network heard that I had free capacity, I got several offers for microjobs, so I don't need to be stressed. Financially, I have my costs covered for half a year, and new income is coming in. I am still looking for a serious big contract, but I don't need to rush into a deal. This gives me a good starting position for negotiations.\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Who is coming?\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ## Why You Might (or Might Not) Want to Work With Me\nI\u2019m currently looking for a job, so I should probably talk about how amazing I am\u2014but I won\u2019t. Instead, I want to talk about my weaknesses.\n### First-Impression Disaster Specialist\nAre you good at making a great first impression? I\u2019m not. It takes time for people to start liking me. I have bad speaking habits: poor pronunciation, and I tend to speak too fast. Usually, I think of interesting questions after the meeting is over. I\u2019m not great at small talk. While I understand the value of social interactions, I transitioned from social work (where I spent a few years) to IT because I realized I prefer interacting with computers over people.\n### Not a Single-Topic Specialist\nI studied at a veterinary high school, then earned a bachelor's degree in andragogy and sociology. A few years later, I moved into online marketing, specifically SEO, and then into Drupal-based web development. I have 8+ years of experience with PHP, two years with Python, and one year with TypeScript. I\u2019m also an AWS Certified Developer Associate and currently studying GenAI. Yep, I\u2019ve taken some hacking courses too...\nBut where is my strongest expertise? Some people criticize me for jumping from one topic to another. It\u2019s true. I\u2019ve written tons of PHP code, but do I understand everything? No. Without an IDE and documentation, my skills drop significantly. I rely on tools, and without them, I don\u2019t know as much. My strength isn\u2019t deep expertise in one topic\u2014it\u2019s a multidisciplinary approach, flexibility, and a passion for exploration.\n### Not Naturally Gifted\nAm I talented? I know people who are much better than me. I\u2019m not a gifted genius. Everything I\u2019ve achieved is the result of hard work and perseverance.\nFor example, I\u2019d love to speak better English. I have a personal teacher and try to use English as my primary working language. I\u2019ve made progress, but I know I could be better. Some concepts take me multiple readings to fully grasp. That\u2019s why I like Udemy courses\u2014I can rewatch lessons as many times as needed. I\u2019ve also spent a lot of time studying SOLID principles and design patterns, but I still wouldn\u2019t say I fully understand them. I\u2019m working on it. Occasionally, I look at old code and think, What the hell is this?\u2014only to realize I wrote it. I\u2019m not perfect, but I\u2019m constantly \"debugging\" myself.\n### I\u2019m a Vegetarian\nI\u2019ve been a vegetarian for more than half my life. I\u2019m not militant about it, but it\u2019s not always easy to invite me to dinner. If you like Asian food, there\u2019s no problem\u2014most Asian restaurants have vegetarian options. Typically, I don\u2019t eat lunch.\n### Why Am I Writing This?\nI don\u2019t want to waste anyone\u2019s time. I like efficiency. I have certain limitations, and it\u2019s good to be aware of them before we start any negotiations. If you see red flags in what I\u2019ve written, that\u2019s great\u2014it means we\u2019re not a fit. If you don\u2019t, then let\u2019s discuss what we can do for each other.\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I am working on a children's handwriting detector. The goal is for children to write some text, and AI will read it and mark errors. The problem is that the OCR models I have tested read children's handwriting incorrectly. The best results are from OpenAI, but it automatically fixes mistakes, so it isn't suitable for error detection. I think I will fine-tune an OCR model to detect children's handwriting as it is, but maybe there's a better way to go about it.\nDo you have any ideas on how to approach this?\nhashtag\n#\nAI\nhashtag\n#\nOCR\nhttps://lnkd.in/eKCrWxkt\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I just signed a mutual termination agreement. Starting in March, I will be unemployed, so I am open to new opportunities. \ud83d\ude09\n\nMetadata: 1 month ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: The worst performance metric ever: the number of lines of code.\n\nMetadata: 2 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I'm thinking about the future. Right now, GenAI frontier models have a better knowledge base than most people, and in a few months, they will surpass everyone. However, in the job market, having a strong knowledge base is essential to getting a job. At the same time, we are becoming lazier by relying on GenAI, which leads to \"forgetting\" unused skills\u2014and it's not our fault; it's simply the evolution of efficiency.\nFor example, I tried writing code without an IDE or internet access, and it was very difficult. Modern IDEs provide features that make memorizing documentation unnecessary because it's readily available within the IDE. However, without an IDE, my coding skills feel downgraded. In reality, I always use an IDE, so I don't need to memorize as much, and with an IDE, I work much faster.\nIn real life, we use many tools, which is good because they make us evolutionarily efficient. However, the job market still expects us to function without them. We now have tools more powerful than any human, yet we resist fully embracing them because we believe that everyone must first understand how they work to use them. But that isn't true\u2014I have very limited knowledge of semiconductors, yet I use them every day.\nWe should ask ourselves whether humans are truly prepared for AI. I often read about AI's potential and how important it is for companies, but at the same time, I see \"good old processes\" still in place that don\u2019t account for this new reality.\n\nMetadata: 2 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Drupal Theme Developer \u2260 Me\nI am a backend developer. I appreciate receiving several offers for Drupal Theme Lead positions, but I am not skilled in frontend development. Therefore, I am not a good candidate for this role. Please don't spam my inbox with these positions.\n\nMetadata: 2 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Probably every company wants to have flexible employees. Flexibility sounds good, but in reality, we often have to deal with KPIs. How does your company measure employee flexibility? Does your company have any form of appreciation for employee flexibility, or is flexibility just a word that looks good in company documents, without any mechanism to measure or acknowledge it?\n\nMetadata: 2 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: One of my goals for 2024 is done.\n\nMetadata: 4 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Pokus o podvod ve st\u00e1diu p\u0159\u00edpravy\nJeden fake profil z Facebooku se m\u011b sna\u017e\u00ed nal\u00e1kat na investice do kryptom\u011bn na platform\u011b HVB. V kryptom\u011bn\u00e1ch ani investic\u00edch nejsem zelen\u00e1\u010d a nikdy jsem o t\u00e9 platform\u011b nesly\u0161el. Taky jsem si ov\u011b\u0159il, \u017ee ten profil je ukraden\u00e9 jm\u00e9no a fotka re\u00e1ln\u00e9 osoby, zn\u00e1m\u00e9ho \u010desk\u00e9ho investora. Psal jsem mu a on se od toho profilu distancoval. M\u00edsto odkazu na web platformy po mn\u011b ten podvodn\u00edk chce, abych mu umo\u017enil nastavit \u00fa\u010det na t\u00e9 \"platform\u011b\" a za\u010d\u00edt \"vyd\u011bl\u00e1vat\". Tohle je \u010dast\u00fd sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159.  O\u010dek\u00e1v\u00e1m, \u017ee bude cht\u00edt, abych si st\u00e1hl n\u00e1stroj pro vzd\u00e1lenou plochu a nebo n\u011bjakou applikaci z pochybn\u00e9ho zdroje. Seriozn\u00ed nab\u00eddka to nen\u00ed, to je jasn\u00e9. Jen\u017ee co s t\u00edm?\nAsi nejjednodu\u0161\u00ed cesta je zablokovat ho, ale t\u00edm mu nezabr\u00e1n\u00edm v t\u00e9 \u010dinnosti pokra\u010dovat. Policie nem\u00e1 online kontaktn\u00ed formul\u00e1\u0159/podporu,respektive nic jsem takov\u00e9ho nena\u0161el (\nstoponline.cz\npodvody nezaj\u00edmaj\u00ed). Musel bych s t\u00edm j\u00edt na slu\u017eebnu a tam by asi ani nepochopili, o co se jedn\u00e1 (jednou u\u017e jsem n\u011bco podobn\u00e9ho nahla\u0161oval a opakoval jsem to t\u0159em lidem, ne\u017e to n\u011bkdo dok\u00e1zal aspo\u0148 d\u00e1t na pap\u00edr).\nPo\u010d\u00edta\u010dov\u00e1 kriminalita je na vzestupu, ale nem\u00e1m mo\u017enost, jak n\u011bco takov\u00e9ho hl\u00e1sit n\u011bkomu, kdo to ch\u00e1pe.  Ka\u017edou chvilku \u010dtu o tom, jak n\u011bkomu takhle vykradli \u00fa\u010det, ale kdy\u017e hled\u00e1m informace, jak to nahl\u00e1sit/zastavit, tak nikde nic.\n\nMetadata: 4 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: A lot of people are confused by Jaguar's rebranding. It doesn\u2019t make sense if you prefer the good old times when cars were powered by gas. However, if you like electric cars and dislike Tesla because its owner is toxic, then Jaguar\u2019s electric cars are a clear alternative\u2014futuristic cars with a futuristic design for futuristic people\nhashtag\n#\ntatamotors\nhashtag\n#\ntesla\nhashtag\n#\njaguar\n\nMetadata: 4 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I receive a lot of job offers, but without any information about the salary. I enjoy programming, but it's still work that I do for money. I\u2019m not doing it for benefits, a nice environment, or a good team, but for the paycheck. I don\u2019t understand why headhunters and HR don\u2019t discuss salary in their job offers. Who wants to send a CV, spend time, and then find out that the offer pays less than their current job? It doesn\u2019t make sense.\n\nMetadata: 5 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I tried to explain the single responsibility principle to my 7-year-old daughter. She didn\u2019t understand it until I used a metaphor with a drawing of a cat where someone added a pig\u2019s snout. It\u2019s supposed to be a cat, not a pig-cat. With that metaphor, she got the point.\n\nMetadata: 5 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Manual for LinkedIn headhunters ;) :D\n\nMetadata: 6 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Are you looking for a Drupal Theming Lead in Prague? If so, keep searching. I'm not the person you're looking for. I'm a backend developer.\nI've received several same job offers, but none of the recruiters seem to actually care about what I really do.\n\nMetadata: 6 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: People are irrationally more afraid of artificial intelligence than of natural stupidity.\n\nMetadata: 8 months ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: U\u017e 10 m\u011bs\u00edc\u016f mi chod\u00ed stejn\u00fd inzer\u00e1t na pozici Drupal developer. Za t\u011bch 10 m\u011bs\u00edc\u016f nikoho nesehnali, ale inzer\u00e1t nezm\u011bnili.  O\u010dek\u00e1val bych, \u017ee IT firma, kter\u00e1 nab\u00edz\u00ed i UX slu\u017eby,  bude zkou\u0161et A/B testov\u00e1n\u00ed i v inzerci. Nezkou\u0161\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: From some job offers by headhunters, one gets the feeling that they have read this manual.\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: My cyber library is growing...\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: New captcha on OpenAI. Every prompt in the free version has to be submitted by solving this captcha.\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: For clickjacking, it's ideal to use an element that the user clicks on without even thinking about it. So the cookie banner has become the perfect way to make users click on something they didn't actually want to click on.\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Meta\n- 1 Scammer way\nMost of Ad in my Facebook feed are scams. I reported it several times and it hasn't any effect. I think, that Meta like dirty money. Meta - scammers way.\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Every second ad on Facebook in my feed is a scam.\nMeta\nis playing dead. I reported it several times, but nothing. How difficult can it be to detect such a simple scam? Why doesn't Meta do something about it?\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u010cist\u011b teoretick\u00e9 cvi\u010den\u00ed: Jak ho ulov\u00edte? Zn\u00e1te jen email a pen\u011b\u017eenku.\nN\u00e1pov\u011bda: \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed nemus\u00ed b\u00fdt \u00fapln\u011b leg\u00e1ln\u00ed\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Membership sale is now over! Thank you for the support and if you missed it then follow us to get notified when it happens again sometime next year.\nBelow is the original message announcing the Membership sale:\nThe $5 Membership sale is now live! The sale lasts until July 17 23:59 UTC:\nhttps://lnkd.in/gcXxyiCk\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \"Zak\u00e1zan\u00e9 budou i\u00a0programy, kter\u00e9 automaticky t\u0159\u00edd\u00ed ob\u010dany na z\u00e1klad\u011b charakteristik, jako jsou pohlav\u00ed, zdravotn\u00ed stav nebo t\u0159eba sexu\u00e1ln\u00ed orientace.\"\nTo zn\u00ed jako konec personalizovan\u00e9 reklamy.  Quo vadis?\nhashtag\n#\nEU\nhashtag\n#\nfail\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Facebook is filled with spam and scam posts. I expected that the current level of AI, combined with user feedback, could easily combat spam. However, for some reason, it doesn't.\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: The Cattell-Horn theory of intelligence suggests that there are two major types of intellectual abilities that fall under the umbrella of general intelligence.\nThese include crystallized intelligence, or the accumulation of knowledge, which is tested through vocabulary and general knowledge assessments, among others.\nThe other type is fluid intelligence, which refers to mental processes that are utilized when dealing with new or unfamiliar situations and is essential in the acquisition of crystallized intelligence.\nIn my opinion, achieving fluid intelligence through computers is impossible, but crystallized intelligence is attainable. We cannot simulate the intelligence of a young mind (fluid intelligence), but we can simulate the structured intelligence of an older mind (crystallized intelligence).\nhashtag\n#\nintelligence\nhashtag\n#\npsychology\nhashtag\n#\nHI\nhashtag\n#\nAI\n\nMetadata: 1 year ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I tried the concept of an\nhashtag\n#\nAI\npriest, and it looks like it can work.\nAn AI priest can teach the concept of religion. People are still important as emotional support, but concepts can be taught by AI.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Prompt Artist\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Local version of GPT4 for command line.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Plugins can extend the functionalities of ChatGPT. Integrating with platforms such as Wolfram and Zapier can have a significant impact.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: ChatGPT-4 is able to describe an image or read handwriting. Does it mean the end for CAPTCHA?\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u010ctu pracovn\u00ed inzer\u00e1ty, ikdy\u017e pr\u00e1ci nehled\u00e1m. Pro\u010d? Abych m\u011bl p\u0159edstavu o po\u017eadavc\u00edch na technologie a znalostech, kter\u00e9 jsou \"nutnost\".\nCo m\u011b na inzer\u00e1tech p\u0159ekvapuje je neust\u00e1l\u00e9 vy\u017eadov\u00e1n\u00ed V\u0160 technick\u00e9ho sm\u011bru. Jako pro\u010d? To by nezam\u011bstnali ani Gatese, Jobse, Zuckerberga, Page, \u010di Bina. V\u0161ichni ode\u0161li z V\u0160.\nT\u00edm ne\u0159\u00edk\u00e1m, \u017ee je form\u00e1ln\u00ed vzd\u011bl\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed \u0161patn\u00e9. Pro pr\u016fm\u011brn\u00e9 lidi je to to nejlep\u0161\u00ed. Pro ty pr\u016fm\u011brn\u00e9...\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: hashtag\n#\nopenAI\nand CZ to EN translations\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I teaching AI how create custom Drupal module\nhashtag\n#\nOpenAI\nhashtag\n#\nDrupal\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: I bought some new books to my library.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: What you need to know about Mastodon\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u00davod do anatomie  scamu\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Stal jsem se ob\u011bt\u00ed spoofingu. Co\u017e znamen\u00e1, \u017ee jsem na\u0161tval scammera, kter\u00fd m\u011b cht\u011bl okr\u00e1st. Te\u010f ten scammer pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 moje star\u00e9 telefonn\u00ed \u010d\u00edslo k podvodn\u00fdm hovor\u016fm. Hl\u00e1\u0161eno na Policii i na\nVodafone\n, kter\u00fd se nezmohl ani na odpov\u011b\u010f.\nSpoofing je metoda podvr\u017een\u00ed telefonn\u00edho \u010d\u00edsla. Um\u00ed to ka\u017ed\u00e1 digit\u00e1ln\u00ed telefonn\u00ed \u00fast\u0159edna. V praxi to znamen\u00e1, \u017ee nem\u016f\u017eete v\u011b\u0159it \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9mu \u010d\u00edslu, ze kter\u00e9ho v\u00e1m n\u011bkdo vol\u00e1. Klidn\u011b to m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt \u00fato\u010dn\u00edk. Jedinou mo\u017enost\u00ed ov\u011b\u0159en\u00ed je zavolat zp\u011bt. To se dovol\u00e1te skute\u010dn\u00e9mu majiteli \u010d\u00edsla. Tak\u017ee pokud si nejste jisti t\u00edm, kdo je na druh\u00e9m konci, tak hovor ukon\u010dete a zavolejte mu zp\u011bt ;).\nM\u00e9 star\u00e9 \u010d\u00edslo 776582244 jsem j\u00e1 s\u00e1m nahl\u00e1sil na v\u0161echny mo\u017en\u00e9 slu\u017eby, kde se hodnot\u00ed telefonn\u00ed \u010d\u00edsla. J\u00e1 u\u017e ho pou\u017e\u00edvat nebudu. Je to odepsan\u00e9 \u010d\u00edslo, na kter\u00e9m blokuju v\u0161echny hovory. Mo\u017en\u00e1 si ho nech\u00e1m do budoucna jako honeypot, ale zcela jist\u011b v\u00e1m z n\u011bj nezavol\u00e1m ani nep\u0159ijmu hovor.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dal\u0161\u00ed scammer: +420736267292. Za posledn\u00ed t\u0159i m\u011bs\u00edce u\u017e druh\u00fd. Tentokr\u00e1t jsem si n\u011bkde zalo\u017eil \u00fa\u010det, dostal tam automaticky 70 USD a to se automaticky zhodnotilo. \u00da\u010det mi ov\u0161em mus\u00ed zru\u0161it a pen\u00edze p\u0159ev\u00e9st na m\u016fj \u00fa\u010det. S t\u00edm mi pom\u016f\u017ee p\u0159es \"chatovac\u00ed aplikaci\" AnyDesk.\nTenhle \u00fatok je tot\u00e1ln\u011b profl\u00e1knut\u00fd  Fakt nech\u00e1pu, \u017ee se na to n\u011bkdo chytne. Tohle ani nejsou hacke\u0159i. Hacker by si aspo\u0148 zjistil, komu vol\u00e1.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Many thanks to\nHamza Javaid\nfor care about my family during their visit of Cyprus.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dnes jsem \u010detl, \u017ee nej\u010dast\u011bji se te\u010f \u0161\u00ed\u0159\u00ed malware emailem, kde je v p\u0159\u00edloze .exe soubor, kter\u00fd mus\u00ed u\u017eivatel s\u00e1m spustit.\nTo fakt existuj\u00ed lid\u00e9, kte\u0159\u00ed spou\u0161t\u00ed n\u00e1hodn\u011b .exe soubory, kter\u00e9 jim p\u0159ijdou emailem?\nAno, \u0159e\u010dnick\u00e1 ot\u00e1zka. Je zjevn\u00e9, \u017ee existuj\u00ed, jinak by tenhle typ \u00fatoku nemohl fungovat.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u0160el jsem kolem \u0158editelstv\u00ed silnic a d\u00e1lnic. Do\u0161lo mi, \u017ee \u00fato\u010dn\u00edci to m\u011bli docela jednoduch\u00e9. Hned vedle chodn\u00edku maj\u00ed ku\u0159\u00e1ckou boudi\u010dku. Takovou krytou, tak\u017ee nevid\u00ed na chodn\u00edk, ale z chodn\u00edku dob\u0159e sly\u0161\u00edte, co si tam u c\u00edga pov\u00eddaj\u00ed. Pro soci\u00e1ln\u00ed in\u017een\u00fdrstv\u00ed skv\u011bl\u00e9 m\u00edsto. Zjist\u00edte jm\u00e9na, pozice, co kdo \u0159e\u0161\u00ed. To jde vyu\u017e\u00edt pro phishing email, na kter\u00fd prost\u011b kliknete, proto\u017ee sed\u00ed jm\u00e9no i t\u00e9ma.\nTaky by m\u011b zaj\u00edmalo, co by se stalo, kdyby jim tam dal n\u011bkdo na stole\u010dek rubber ducky usb. Ke ku\u0159\u00e1ck\u00e9mu stole\u010dku bych mohl z ulice doj\u00edt bez jak\u00e9koliv kontroly. Zasunul by n\u011bkdo \"ztracenou flashku\" do po\u010d\u00edta\u010de, aby zjistil, \u010d\u00ed to je? Bylo to p\u0159eci v ku\u0159\u00e1ck\u00e9m koutku, kam chod\u00ed jen oni...\nJe to u\u017e n\u011bjak\u00e1 doba od toho \u00fatoku a po\u0159\u00e1d tam maj\u00ed bezpe\u010dnostn\u00ed trhliny.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Pr\u00e1v\u011b mi volal +420734403872. N\u011bjak\u00fd Slov\u00e1k. M\u00e1m pr\u00fd zapomenut\u00e9 krypto na\nBTC.com\n. Pr\u00fd se to mus\u00ed rychle prodat, proto\u017ee cena jde dolu. J\u00e1 m\u00e1m teda n\u011bkolik kryptopen\u011b\u017eenek, ale ani jednu na\nBTC.com\n. Hned jsem si i ov\u011b\u0159il, \u017ee tam \u00fa\u010det fakt nem\u00e1m.\nChl\u00e1pek vyzv\u00eddal info o m\u00fdch \u00fa\u010dtech, kam mi ty pen\u00edze za \"zapomenut\u00e9 BTC\" m\u00e1 poslat. Jen\u017ee j\u00e1 tyhle triky zn\u00e1m, proto\u017ee m\u011b IT security bav\u00ed a celkem \u010dasto \u010dtu i o n\u011bjak\u00fdch podvodech. No kdy\u017e jsem si b\u011bhem telefon\u00e1tu za\u010dal ov\u011b\u0159ovat ten \u00fa\u010det, tak to asi pochopil a zav\u011bsil. Co\u017e je \u0161koda, proto\u017ee jsem byl tak trochu zv\u011bdav, kdy m\u011b po\u017e\u00e1d\u00e1 o ops\u00e1n\u00ed k\u00f3du z SMS, nebo bude cht\u00edt, abych si nainstaloval n\u011bjak\u00fd software. P\u0159\u00ed\u0161t\u011b mus\u00edm d\u011blat blb\u00e9ho, nebo zase p\u0159ijdu o z\u00e1bavu.\nhashtag\n#\nphishing\nhashtag\n#\nscam\nhashtag\n#\nbtc\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: What my collegues appreciate on me.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Na programov\u00e1n\u00ed je zaj\u00edmav\u00e9, \u017ee m\u016f\u017eete napsat k\u00f3d, kter\u00fd funguje, ale z\u00e1rove\u0148 je \u00fapln\u011b \u0161patn\u011b.\n\nMetadata: 2 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Ka\u017ed\u00fd n\u011bjak za\u010d\u00ednal\nhashtag\n#\nAWS\n\nMetadata: 4 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: DAPPka\nhttps://coinapp.co\nvyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 geolokaci k t\u011b\u017eb\u011b kryptom\u011bny COIN. Nyn\u00ed m\u00e1 novou funkci. T\u011b\u017e\u00edte, kdy\u017e sed\u00edte doma. Chytr\u00fd zp\u016fsob, jak lidi motivovat ke karant\u00e9n\u011b.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: U\u010d\u00edme Online sh\u00e1n\u00ed notebooky a PC pro \u017e\u00e1ky, kte\u0159\u00ed nemaj\u00ed doma \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 vybaven\u00ed nutn\u00e9 pro online v\u00fduku.\n\u0160koly budou pravd\u011bpodobn\u011b zav\u0159en\u00e9 a\u017e do z\u00e1\u0159\u00ed. Hroz\u00ed, \u017ee n\u011bkte\u0159\u00ed studenti budou odtr\u017eeni od vzd\u011bl\u00e1vac\u00edho procesu.\nNem\u00e1te notebook nav\u00edc?\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: V\u00ed n\u011bkdo o zdroji dat o aktu\u00e1ln\u00edm po\u010dtu sebevra\u017ed? Na\u0161el jsem jen meziro\u010dn\u00ed srovn\u00e1n\u00ed a to je m\u00e1lo. Pot\u0159eboval bych t\u00fddenn\u00ed, nebo aspo\u0148 m\u011bs\u00ed\u010dn\u00ed reporting.\nSmysl: cht\u011bl bych zjistit, jestli m\u00e1 nouzov\u00fd stav vliv na \u010detnost sebevra\u017ed v populaci.\nhashtag\n#\ncovid19\nhashtag\n#\ndatascience\nhashtag\n#\nczechrepublic\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Po\u0159\u00e1d mi chod\u00ed nab\u00eddky od recruiter\u016f. Zkou\u0161\u00ed m\u011b zlana\u0159it. Abych \u0159ekl pravdu, tak jsem za to r\u00e1d. Je to takov\u00e9 lichotiv\u00e9. P\u0159esto v\u017edy odm\u00edt\u00e1m, ikdy\u017e mi nab\u00edz\u00ed docela dost pen\u011bz. Jsem v CN Group spokojen\u00fd. Neum\u00edm si p\u0159edstavit, \u017ee bych se dostal k lep\u0161\u00edmu projektu a i lid\u00e9 u n\u00e1s firm\u011b mi vyhovuj\u00ed. Jednodu\u0161e nen\u00ed d\u016fvod ke zm\u011bn\u011b.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Nouzov\u00fd stav m\u00e1 sv\u00e1 pozitiva. Kone\u010dn\u011b m\u00e1m \u010das dod\u011blat rozd\u011blan\u00e9 projekty.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: In our Bratislava branch, a new round of our on-the-job training programme, CN University, is about to start. This time we focus on React. Do you know someone who would be interested in being a trainee on a programme where they get paid? Share this post and help us find the best students. Do you need to know more about this programme?\nhttps://lnkd.in/gQuUXKh\nhashtag\n#\ntraineeship\nhashtag\n#\ntrainee\nhashtag\n#\ninternship\nhashtag\n#\nreact\nhashtag\n#\ntrainingprogramme\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Z\u00e1kladn\u00ed probl\u00e9m elektronick\u00fdch zn\u00e1mek nen\u00ed je prodat.\nProbl\u00e9m je ov\u011b\u0159ov\u00e1n\u00ed jejich platnosti.\nPokud policajt na mostu sn\u00edm\u00e1 provoz, tak jeho kolegov\u00e9, kte\u0159\u00ed \u010d\u00edhaj\u00ed na odpo\u010d\u00edvadlu o kousek d\u00e1l, pot\u0159ebuj\u00ed v\u011bd\u011bt, \u017ee pr\u00e1v\u011b te\u010f jede auto bez zaplacen\u00e9 d\u00e1lni\u010dn\u00ed zn\u00e1mky. Te\u010f. Ne za minutu, za dv\u011b, nebo ma\u00f1ana... P\u0159i\u010dem\u017e zn\u00e1mky expiruj\u00ed, nov\u00e9 si p\u016fjde koupit online. Jedn\u00e1 se o velk\u00fd objem dat, kter\u00e1 se neust\u00e1le m\u011bn\u00ed. V\u0161e mus\u00ed b\u00fdt  rychl\u00e9 a bezchybn\u011b zpracov\u00e1n\u00e9.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Nov\u00fd trend v\nhashtag\n#\nSEO\nv roce 2020?  Metadata!  A t\u00edm nemysl\u00edm data v hlavi\u010dce webu, ale metadata soubor\u016f.\nPro\u010d to bude trend?  Proto\u017ee\nhashtag\n#\nblockchain\n.  Prozat\u00edm je decentralizovan\u00e9 vyhled\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed v plenk\u00e1ch.  Z velk\u00e9 \u010d\u00e1sti to je i proto, \u017ee se lidi o metadata nezaj\u00edmaj\u00ed, tak\u017ee je nevypl\u0148uj\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Poprv\u00e9 jsem zapsal a n\u00e1sledn\u011b p\u0159e\u010detl data do\nhashtag\n#\nblockchain\n. Nakonec to nen\u00ed tak slo\u017eit\u00e9, jak to na za\u010d\u00e1tku p\u016fsobilo.\nhashtag\n#\nethereum\n,\nhashtag\n#\nganache\n+\nhashtag\n#\ntruffle\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Websites are often the first place candidates go to for more information about a company and its open positions. Therefore, we are very pleased to have won 3rd place in the Recruitment Academy awards! Big thanks to Ivo Kom\u00e1rek, Ji\u0159\u00ed Pokorn\u00fd, Roman Leke\u0161,\nMichaela Postr\u00e1neck\u00e1\n,\nZdenka Krejcikova\n,  Marek Pol\u00e1k, Milan Do, Lud\u011bk Kvapil, Vojta Vagunda a Jakub \u0158\u00ed\u010da\u0159 who have worked on the site\nwww.cnjobs.dk\n.\nhashtag\n#\nrecruitment\nhashtag\n#\nawards\nhashtag\n#\nbigthanks\nhashtag\n#\nopenpositions\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dok\u00e1\u017ee blockchain  nahradit backend?!?\nAno, ale jen pro n\u011bkter\u00e9 aplikace. Stejn\u011b bude v\u017edy dobr\u00e9 m\u00edt vastn\u00ed backendovou aplikaci pro neve\u0159ejnou \u010d\u00e1st dat, ale ta ve\u0159ejn\u00e1 m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt klidn\u011b v blockchainu.\nEthereum nen\u00ed jen kryptom\u011bna, ale je to tak\u00e9 sada n\u00e1stroj\u016f (Ganache, truffle) a JavaScriptov\u00e1 knihovna pro vlastn\u00ed pr\u00e1ci s blockchain techologi\u00ed. Nastal \u010das nau\u010dit se web3.js a Solidity.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: P\u0159i\u0161el mi do vzkazn\u00edku spam, \u017ee mi cht\u011bj\u00ed p\u0159edat tajemstv\u00ed \u00fasp\u011bchu na LinkedIn. Pamatuju doby, kdy tajemstv\u00ed bylo n\u011bco, co nepos\u00edl\u00e1te random lidem do vzkazn\u00edku, ale j\u00e1 jsem se narodil v minul\u00e9m stolet\u00ed, tak\u017ee  tomuto doublespeaku zjevn\u011b u\u017e nerozum\u00edm.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Zn\u00e1te takov\u00e9 to r\u010den\u00ed, \u017ee pen\u00edze se v\u00e1l\u00ed je tak na ulici. Sta\u010d\u00ed je jen zvednout?\nNa soci\u00e1ln\u00edch s\u00edt\u00edch jsem se do\u010detl, \u017ee p\u0159ed jedn\u00edm obchodn\u00edm domem smrd\u00ed semena jinanu dvoulalo\u010dnat\u00e9ho  (Ginkgo biloba). Tak jsem hned zpozornil. Semena jsem si toti\u017e objedn\u00e1val p\u0159edchoz\u00ed den. Nejlevn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed, kter\u00e1 jsem na\u0161el, st\u00e1la 8 K\u010d za ks + po\u0161tovn\u00e9.\nP\u0159ed obcho\u010f\u00e1kem, kde projdou stovky lid\u00ed za hodinu, jsem na\u0161el  minim\u00e1ln\u011b 800 K\u010d. Nikdo si jich nev\u0161\u00edmal a n\u011bkdo si na n\u011b dokonce i st\u011b\u017eoval!\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Na co je dobr\u00fd titul z andragogiky?\nPodle m\u011b je to jeden z nejsm\u011b\u0161n\u011bj\u0161\u00edch titul\u016f. V\u011bda, kter\u00e1 ani nev\u00ed, jestli je doopravdy v\u011bda a kter\u00e1 po\u0159\u00e1d \u0159e\u0161\u00ed n\u011bjak\u00e9 probl\u00e9my s legitimizac\u00ed sebe sama jako v\u011bdn\u00ed discipl\u00edny. Interdisciplin\u00e1rn\u00ed v\u011bda, kter\u00e1 bere ze v\u0161eho tro\u0161ku. Prost\u011b gul\u00e1\u0161, n\u011bkdy i UHO.\nNa co je dobr\u00e9 pochopit andragogiku?\nBudete se um\u011bt u\u010dit. Cel\u00fd \u017eivot. Samostatn\u011b i ve skupin\u011b. Rychle, efektivn\u011b, systematicky. Taky n\u011bco pochop\u00edte o lidech a t\u0159eba i o sob\u011b. Sebevzd\u011bl\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed a sebekultivace je nejlep\u0161\u00ed konkuren\u010dn\u00ed v\u00fdhoda. K nezaplacen\u00ed!\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Hlod stolet\u00ed: \"A tak\u00e9 si mysl\u00edm, \u017ee v sou\u010dasn\u00e9 chv\u00edli je provoz webu s Drupalem 8 sp\u00ed\u0161e ot\u00e1zkou presti\u017ee a machrov\u00e1n\u00ed, ne\u017e racion\u00e1ln\u00ed \u00favahy.\"  Jan Polzer\nDrupalu 7 p\u0159\u00ed\u0161t\u00ed rok kon\u010d\u00ed podpora, ale migrace na novou verzi je machrov\u00e1n\u00ed. Racion\u00e1ln\u00ed \u00favahu v tom nehledejte. Sp\u00ed\u0161e neochotu u\u010dit se nov\u00fd v\u011bcem.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dostali jsme od klienta task:\n\"In order to prepare for the Oktoberfest (here everybody says \"Wiesn\" = \"Wiese\" = meadow; it comes from the place where the Oktoberfest takes place which is called Theresienwiese), please study these top X Wiesn songs. Listen to them for at least 3 hours a day and learn them by heart:\nhttps://g.co/kgs/7aBGkr\n\"\n:D\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Tich\u00e1 po\u0161ta\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdy\u017e n\u011bkdo nezn\u00e1m\u00fd umyl grafity z Karlova mostu, tak to bylo pro pana nezn\u00e1m\u00e9ho ztr\u00e1tov\u00e9, charita.\nPokud se pan nezn\u00e1m\u00fd k tomu \u010dinu p\u0159iznal, tak u\u017e je to guerilla marketing. Vynalo\u017een\u00e1 pr\u00e1ce a prost\u0159edky jsou tak n\u00e1klady na marketing.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: M\u00e1te n\u011bkdo PhotoShop na Linuxu?\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Poka\u017ed\u00e9, kdy\u017e tohle video vid\u00edm, tak si \u0159\u00edk\u00e1m, \u017ee u\u017e se to snad v reklam\u011b ned\u011bje.\nAle ruku do ohn\u011b bych za to fakt nedal.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1te n\u011bkdo Mautic?\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \"Hl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed o poru\u0161en\u00ed z\u00e1sad ve slu\u017eb\u011b AdSense ze strany majitele str\u00e1nek\"  -> SPAM od\nGoogle\n.\nPro\u010d spam?  Proto\u017ee skute\u010dn\u00e1 zpr\u00e1va p\u00ed\u0161e n\u011bjak\u00e1 fakta a ned\u00e1v\u00e1 jen odkaz na v\u0161eobecn\u00e9 podm\u00ednky, kter\u00e9 dle m\u00e9ho n\u00e1zoru spl\u0148uju. Googlu se n\u011bco nel\u00edb\u00ed, ale nenap\u00ed\u0161e co. Zaj\u00edmav\u00e9 je, \u017ee reklama b\u011b\u017e\u00ed v\u0161ude d\u00e1l. Zas tak moc jim to poru\u0161en\u00ed tajemn\u00e9 z\u00e1hady zjevn\u011b nevad\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Hled\u00e1me Drupalisty\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: St\u00e1le se zasek\u00e1vaj\u00edc\u00ed\nhashtag\n#\nphpStorm\nod\nJetBrains\nm\u011b dnes p\u0159ipravil tak o hodinu a p\u016fl pracovn\u00edho \u010dasu.\n\nMetadata: 5 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Z 22 t\u00fdm\u016f byl  lep\u0161\u00ed jen t\u00fdm Francie.\nhashtag\n#\nKdoNeskaceNeniCech\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Nemo\u017en\u00e9 se stalo re\u00e1ln\u00e9: migruj\u00ed, ale nemaj\u00ed z\u00e1lohu.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: hashtag\n#\nschoolstrike4climate\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Nen\u00ed den, aby\nhashtag\n#\nPHPStorm\nnespadl, nebo nezamrzl.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: hashtag\n#\nPhpStorm\nje asi fajn IDE, ale ne pokud pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1te Linux.  Po\u0159\u00e1d to jen indexuje a velmi \u010dasto se to b\u011bhem on\u00e9 indexace zasekne a u\u017e s t\u00edm nejde nic ud\u011blat. Jako pr\u00e1v\u011b te\u010f. Tak\u017ee m\u00e1m IDE, kter\u00e9 nefunguje. To je p\u0159esn\u011b to, co do IDE nechcete.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: hashtag\n#\nvalentineday\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: AR konference zn\u00ed zaj\u00edmav\u011b. Mo\u017en\u00e1 za p\u00e1r let budou AR za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed b\u011b\u017en\u00e1 jako dnes mobily, ale zat\u00edm to je sp\u00ed\u0161e jen takov\u00e1 technick\u00e1 zaj\u00edmavost.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Z\u00e1kaz maz\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f!\nPtal jsem se koleg\u016f, jak by \u0159e\u0161ili dokazov\u00e1n\u00ed, \u017ee jim n\u011bkdo smazal p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek.\nScreenshot s\u00e1m nesta\u010d\u00ed, proto\u017ee PhotoShop.\nAby to \u0161lo prok\u00e1zat, musel by existovat st\u00e1tem certifikovan\u00fd sledovac\u00ed syst\u00e9m, kter\u00fd bude v\u0161echny va\u0161e p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky sledovat, d\u011blat screeny ov\u011b\u0159en\u00e9 elektronick\u00fdm podpisem a n\u00e1sledn\u011b to n\u011bkam ukl\u00e1d\u00e1t. A to nechcete.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Doch\u00e1zka, jako d\u016fkaz pracovitosti?\nPoslanci a tud\u00ed\u017e i m\u00e9dia \u0159e\u0161\u00ed doch\u00e1zku do sn\u011bmovny. P\u0159i\u0161lo mi p\u0159\u00edzna\u010dn\u00e9, \u017ee se v\u00fdkonnost poslance nem\u011b\u0159\u00ed dle po\u010dtu navr\u017een\u00fdch z\u00e1kon\u016f, po\u010dtu p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f, po\u010dtu vystoupen\u00ed, nebo jin\u00e9 v\u00fdkonnostn\u00ed metriky, ale podle jeho doch\u00e1zky.\nNikdo ne\u0159e\u0161\u00ed, jestli konkr\u00e9tn\u00ed poslanec pracoval, ale sta\u010d\u00ed, \u017ee byl v pr\u00e1ci, tud\u00ed\u017e je pracovit\u00fd.\nJe to jednotliv\u00fd projev, ale tento vzorece se t\u00e1hne celou na\u0161\u00ed spole\u010dnost\u00ed.  \u0160kolu si mus\u00edte odchodit, nikoliv se tam n\u011bco nau\u010dit. Sta\u010d\u00ed tam b\u00fdt. Stejn\u011b pak lid\u00e9 p\u0159istupuj\u00ed i k pr\u00e1ci. Dobrou zpr\u00e1vou je, \u017ee je to kulturn\u011b podm\u00edn\u011bn\u00e9. \u0160patnou zpr\u00e1vou je, \u017ee tento kulturn\u00ed zvyk je v \u010cR siln\u011b zako\u0159en\u011bn\u00fd.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: LinkedIn mi navrhuje, abych pop\u0159\u00e1l Markovi k narozenin\u00e1m, ale on je mrtv\u00fd, tak\u017ee si to stejn\u011b nep\u0159e\u010dte.\nA\u017e jednou v\u0161ichni pom\u0159eme, tak  soci\u00e1ln\u00ed s\u00edt\u011b budou ka\u017ed\u00fdm rokem oslavovat na\u0161e narozen\u00ed a \u00fasp\u011bchy. Na internetu je ka\u017ed\u00fd sv\u00fdm zp\u016fsobem st\u00e1le \u017eiv\u00fd.  Dokud n\u011bkdo nesma\u017ee posledn\u00ed bit.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Web, kter\u00fd se mi fakt l\u00edb\u00ed. Spousta dat na jednom m\u00edst\u011b. Prost\u011b bo\u017e\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: N\u011bkter\u00e9 projekty jsem zaznamenal, ale o v\u011bt\u0161in\u011b \u010dtu a\u017e z n\u00e1hrobku.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Jsem v CN Group u\u017e rok. Tak jsem si \u0159ekl o v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed plat a dostal jsem ho.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Od bootu do spu\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010de necel\u00e9 dv\u011b minuty.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: EU rozv\u00edj\u00ed vlastn\u00ed distribuci Drupalu\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdy\u017e pot\u0159ebujete ikonku (Apache license version 2.0.)\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Drupal ve slu\u017eb\u00e1ch NASA. B\u011bhem zatm\u011bn\u00ed slunce ust\u00e1l n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvnost 40 milion\u016f zobrazen\u00ed za 6 hodin. To by WordPress nedal.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Te\u010f si p\u0159edstavte, \u017ee jste nikdy nebyli v Evrop\u011b, tak\u017ee tomu uv\u011b\u0159\u00edte. Stejn\u00e9 bludy p\u00ed\u0161ou n\u011bkter\u00e9 m\u00e9dia i v \u010cR o no-go z\u00f3nach a podobn\u00fdch nesmyslech. Kdy\u017e necestujete, nev\u00edte a prost\u011b t\u011bm kec\u016fm v\u011b\u0159\u00edte.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Od \u010dervence pracuju na projektu pro Burda forward. Maj\u00ed tam headless Drupal \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed, co\u017e bude pro m\u011b zase n\u011bco nov\u00e9ho.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Pomalu se bl\u00ed\u017e\u00edme ke konci projektu. Klient dnes na standupu pronesl, \u017ee navrhne moje pov\u00fd\u0161en\u00ed. Vzhledem k tomu, \u017ee na za\u010d\u00e1tku projektu\u00a0 m\u011bli v\u016f\u010di m\u011b v\u00fdhrady, to je docela p\u011bkn\u00fd pokrok.\n\nMetadata: 6 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Empresa media vytv\u00e1\u0159\u00ed jen medi\u00e1ln\u00ed odpad. Tam nepracuj\u00ed \u017e\u00e1dn\u00ed novin\u00e1\u0159i, ale jen propagandisti\u010dt\u00ed pis\u00e1lkov\u00e9.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Po p\u016fl roce v\u00fdvoje jsme spustili novou verzi\nSportAktiv.com\n.\u00a0 #Drupal8\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Za chvilku m\u00e1 vstoupit v platnost GPDR.\u00a0 A jak to vypad\u00e1, \u017ee odborn\u00e1 ve\u0159ejnost v\u016fbec netu\u0161\u00ed, jak GPDR ch\u00e1pat.\n\u010ctu diskuzi, \u017ee IP adresa je osobn\u00ed \u00fadaj, co\u017e je nesmysl. Osobn\u00ed \u00fadajem se m\u016f\u017ee st\u00e1t ve vztahu k jin\u00fdm dat\u016fm, ale sama o sob\u011b IP osobn\u00ed \u00fadajem nikdy ani b\u00fdt nem\u016f\u017ee. Stejn\u011b jako n\u00e1zev ulice a \u010d\u00edslo popisn\u00e9 nen\u00ed osobn\u00ed \u00fadajem, dokud ne\u0159eknu, kdo tam bydl\u00ed.\u00a0 A\u017e pak je to osobn\u00ed \u00fadaj. Do t\u00e9 doby je to jen informace o geografii m\u011bsta.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdy\u017e jsem byl mal\u00e9 d\u00edt\u011b, tak mi \u0159ekli, \u017ee m\u00e1m dyslexii a dysgrafii.\nDle m\u00e9ho n\u00e1zoru se to projevuje jen v dikt\u00e1tech, nebo kdy\u017e mus\u00edm n\u011bco rychle napsat. U\u017e jako d\u00edt\u011b jsem hodn\u011b \u010detl a tak v\u00edm, jak maj\u00ed slova vypadat. Co\u017e nen\u00ed v\u017edy \u00fapln\u011b dobr\u00e9, ale jako prvn\u00ed z\u00e1chytn\u00fd filtr to funguje dob\u0159e. V\u017edy m\u011b \u0161tavalo, \u017ee si n\u011bkdo mysl\u00ed, \u017ee dyslektik/dysgrafik pot\u0159ebuje n\u011bjakou speci\u00e1ln\u00ed pomoc, \u010di n\u011bjak\u00e9 speci\u00e1ln\u00ed zach\u00e1zen\u00ed. To je podle m\u011b blbost. Pot\u0159ebuje jen hodn\u011b \u010d\u00edst a hl\u00eddat si sv\u00e9 v\u00fdstupy, co\u017e se ostatn\u011b v\u017edy hod\u00ed. Nejen kv\u016fli gramatice, ale tak\u00e9 kv\u016fli obsahu.\nMimochodem i CI5 c\u00edlen\u011b naj\u00edm\u00e1 dyslektiky. M\u00e1me pr\u00fd lep\u0161\u00ed analytick\u00e9 schopnosti. Je to prost\u011b n\u011bco, co m\u016f\u017ee u\u010diteli \u010de\u0161tiny p\u0159ipadat jako nev\u00fdhoda, ale pokud \u010dlov\u011bk d\u011bl\u00e1 analytickou pr\u00e1ci, tak je to sp\u00ed\u0161e v\u00fdhodou.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Pr\u00e1v\u011b mi uplynula zku\u0161ebn\u00ed doba v\nCiklum Czech Republic & Slovakia\nZ\u016fst\u00e1v\u00e1m na neur\u010dito.\nM\u00e1m pocit, jako bych se za posledn\u00ed t\u0159i m\u011bs\u00edce nau\u010dil asi tak stejn\u011b jako za p\u0159edchoz\u00ed rok. Pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 se tu hodn\u011b nov\u00fdch technologi\u00ed a celkov\u011b je to v\u00fd\u017eivn\u00e9 prost\u0159ed\u00ed. Ide\u00e1ln\u00ed pro osobn\u00ed r\u016fst, pokud se ho teda \u010dlov\u011bk neboj\u00ed :).\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Drupal m\u00e1 dnes narozeniny. Sladk\u00fdch 17 let\u00a0 <3\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Nekrmte trolly!\nTak prav\u00ed nej\u010dast\u011bj\u0161\u00ed chybn\u00e1 pou\u010dka o pr\u00e1ci s t\u011bmito zv\u00ed\u0159\u00e1tky. P\u0159itom hladov\u00fd troll je troll, kter\u00fd se potuluje po s\u00edti a hled\u00e1, kde by ukojil sv\u00e9 emoce.\u00a0 Pravidlo \"nemkrmte trolly\" m\u016f\u017ee fungovat lok\u00e1ln\u011b, v jedn\u00e9 konkr\u00e9tn\u00ed diskuzi / vl\u00e1knu, ale nefunguje to v glob\u00e1ln\u00edm m\u011b\u0159\u00edtku.\nPokud je trolling sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed informa\u010dn\u00ed v\u00e1lky, tak m\u016f\u017eeme po\u010d\u00edtat s t\u00edm, \u017ee n\u011bkde n\u011bkdo tr\u00e1v\u00ed sv\u016fj \u010das jen t\u00edm, \u017ee \"rozb\u00edj\u00ed\" diskuze.\u00a0 Pokud konkr\u00e9tn\u00ed diskuze nen\u00ed zaj\u00edmav\u00e1\u00a0 (tzn. alibisti trolla ignoruj\u00ed), tak troll bude \"pracovat\" jinde.\u00a0 8 hodin denn\u011b.\nPokud tedy trolla chceme doopravdy vy\u0159adit, tak\u00a0 ho mus\u00edme zam\u011bstnat. Vytvo\u0159it \"krm\u00edtko\" a tam nal\u00e1kat tolik troll\u016f, kolik je mo\u017en\u00e9.\u00a0 Trolly nezastav\u00edte. Nikdy.\u00a0 Ale m\u016f\u017eete je zabavit tam, kde \u0161kod\u00ed minim\u00e1ln\u011b.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Docker + Portainer a m\u00e1te rychlou a i u\u017eivatelsky p\u0159\u00edjemnou odleh\u010denou virtualizaci\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dnes posledn\u00ed den v\nMcTREE.cz\n. Od koleg\u016f jsem dostal na odchodnou \u010daj a hrn\u00ed\u010dek s Buddhou. A dokonce u\u017e i v\u011bd\u00ed, jak\u00fd \u010daj mi maj\u00ed d\u00e1t.\u00a0 Trochu mi je jich l\u00edto, \u017ee je tady v tom nech\u00e1v\u00e1m, ale odte\u010f se s t\u011bmi eshopy u\u017e budou muset poprat n\u011bjak sami.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: HR by mohli jako sou\u010d\u00e1st propagace uv\u00e1d\u011bt pr\u016fm\u011brn\u00e9 IQ ve firm\u011b. Pracovat s chytr\u00fdmi lidmi je benefit s\u00e1m o sob\u011b.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Volby v dne\u0161n\u00ed dob\u011b nevyhr\u00e1v\u00e1 program, ani pr\u00e1ce, ale jen oby\u010dejn\u00fd marketing a propaganda.\u00a0 Tyto dva obory by se m\u011bly v\u00edce u\u010dit na v\u0161ech \u0161kol\u00e1ch. Je to fakt trapas, \u017ee lid\u00e9 nerozpoznaj\u00ed pravdu od reklamy,\u00a0 fakta od ideologie.\u00a0 V takov\u00e9 situaci bohu\u017eel mus\u00edm konstatovat, \u017ee demokracie prohr\u00e1v\u00e1. V\u00edtejte v \u00e9\u0159e davokracie.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdy se za\u010dnou d\u011blat ty ploty kolem \u010cR? Nerad bych ho musel p\u0159el\u00e9zat.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Poda\u0159ilo se mi zcela zautomatizovat monitoring a reporting cen. Nikdo nemus\u00ed ani kliknout my\u0161\u00ed. I tak ka\u017ed\u00fd den dostanou pov\u011b\u0159en\u00e9 osoby p\u0159ehled cen na trhu aktu\u00e1ln\u011b prod\u00e1van\u00fdch produkt\u016f p\u0159\u00edmo na sv\u016fj email.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: 12 milion\u016f K\u010d m\u00e1 st\u00e1t projekt Wi-fi v metru.\u00a0 Wi-fi host se jmenuje WLAN - Metro. \u0160ifrov\u00e1n\u00ed = \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9.\nNa jednu stranu se tu d\u011bl\u00e1 humbuk kolem KRACK \u00fatoku na WPA2 a z\u00e1rove\u0148 se tu masivn\u011b riskuj\u00ed miliony za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed d\u016fv\u011b\u0159iv\u00fdch ob\u010dan\u016f, kte\u0159\u00ed se na Wi-Fi v metru p\u0159ipoj\u00ed.\nV\u0161echny mo\u017enosti Man in the middle, kter\u00e9 se v\u00e1m po \u00fatoku KRACK nab\u00eddnou, m\u00e1te bez ve vybran\u00fdch stanic\u00edch metra k dispozici ji\u017e dnes. Bez nutnosti \u0159e\u0161it n\u011bjak\u00fd KRACK. Jen si sednete do metra, \"budete \u010dekat na metro\" a mezit\u00edm si kr\u00e1tit \u010das s WireSharkem.\u00a0 Zvl\u00e1dne to i lama.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u010clov\u011bk si jen vyhled\u00e1 p\u00e1r URL na\nZbozi.cz\na hned je z toho \"Possible DOS attack detected\"\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Konec retargetingu na Safari?\u00a0 Jak to asi funguje?\nDle \u010dl\u00e1nku Safari blokuje scripty, kter\u00e9 ukl\u00e1daj\u00ed cookies t\u0159et\u00edch stran i vlastn\u00ed cookies webu.\u00a0 Pro blokaci m\u00e1 slou\u017eit AI.\nV p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b Skliku to je celkem jasn\u00e9. Sklik m\u00e1 vlastn\u00ed retargetinov\u00fd k\u00f3d. Jen\u017ee Google AdWords pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 retargetinov\u00e9 seznamy, kter\u00e9 se vytv\u00e1\u0159\u00ed na z\u00e1klad\u011b analytick\u00e9ho k\u00f3du Universal Analytics. Co\u017e by mohlo znamenet, \u017ee bu\u010f Safari bude blokovat Universal  Analytics, nebo bude blokovat \"jen\" reklamy.\nV prvn\u00edm p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b by jsme o data o u\u017eivatel\u00edch/n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bv\u00e1ch p\u0159i\u0161li, ve druh\u00e9m bychom p\u0159i\u0161li pouze o mo\u017enost na z\u00e1klad\u011b t\u011bch dat inzerovat.\nV prvn\u00edm p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b bychom mohli \u0159\u00edct, \u017ee Apple (Safari) postavilo soukrom\u00ed u\u017eivatel\u016f nad z\u00e1jmy provozovatel\u016f web\u016f (tzn. \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e1 data o n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvnosti). V druh\u00e9m p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b by \u0161lo jen ur\u010dit\u00fd alibismus. Soukrom\u00ed u\u017eivatel\u016f by st\u00e1le bylo naru\u0161eno, jen by z toho nikdo nem\u011bl p\u0159\u00edm\u00fd zisk.\nPokud jsem spr\u00e1vn\u011b pochopil situaci, tak se jedn\u00e1 jen o ten druh\u00fd p\u0159\u00edpad. Tedy \u017ee si Apple usmyslelo, \u017ee nechceme reklamu na m\u00edru. Co\u017e j\u00e1 osobn\u011b teda chci.\u00a0 Soukrom\u00ed nez\u00edsk\u00e1me, jen ztrat\u00edme mo\u017enost dost\u00e1vat obsah, kter\u00fd dost\u00e1vat chceme. A kdo reklamy na m\u00edru nechce? AdBlock funguje u\u017e dlouho, tak\u017ee v \u010dem je probl\u00e9m?\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: P\u016fl kr\u00e1lovstv\u00ed a princeznu k tomu, kdo vymysl\u00ed doopravdy \u00fa\u010dinn\u00fd syst\u00e9m na validaci dat.\u00a0 Respektive nen\u00ed probl\u00e9m data s n\u011b\u010d\u00edm srovn\u00e1vat, ale v\u017edy to srovn\u00e1v\u00e1m s jin\u00fdmi daty, kter\u00e1 takt\u00e9\u017e vytv\u00e1\u0159\u00ed lid\u00e9. A lid\u00e9 jsou nejv\u011bt\u0161\u00ed zdroj chybn\u00fdch dat. U\u017e se t\u011b\u0161\u00edm, a\u017e AI lidskou pr\u00e1ci vytla\u010d\u00ed. Pak snad kone\u010dn\u011b z\u00edsk\u00e1m sv\u00e1 data, kter\u00fdm m\u016f\u017eu v\u011b\u0159it. Douf\u00e1m.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Pravicov\u00fd sociolog je nesmysl. Stejn\u011b jako levicov\u00fd sociolog. Bu\u010f d\u011bl\u00e1te v\u011bdu a ta nesm\u00ed podl\u00e9hat ideologii, nebo d\u011bl\u00e1te propagandu. Oboj\u00ed najednou d\u011blat nelze.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Sociologie bud\u00ed v n\u011bkter\u00fdch lidech dojem, \u017ee to je brnka\u010dka a zvl\u00e1dne to ka\u017ed\u00fd jouda. A tak si jouda zalo\u017e\u00ed agenturu na marketingov\u00fd pr\u016fzkum, kde pokl\u00e1d\u00e1 manipulativn\u00ed a dvojhlav\u0148ov\u00e9 ot\u00e1zky. Tak tohle fakt nen\u00ed v\u00fdzkum, ale uk\u00e1zkov\u00e1 propaganda, kter\u00e1 se za v\u00fdzkum vyd\u00e1v\u00e1.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Um\u011bt je\u0161t\u011b neznamen\u00e1 dok\u00e1zat pou\u017e\u00edt v praxi.\nNa sanda m\u00e1m kolegu, kter\u00fd m\u00e1 siln\u00e9 kopy, kdy\u017e cvi\u010d\u00edme na lapy. P\u0159i sparingu je celkem ne\u0161kodn\u00fd. Po\u0159\u00e1d se sna\u017e\u00ed b\u00fdt z dosahu, tak\u017ee sv\u00e9 siln\u00e9 kopy nevyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1.\u00a0 Nechce dostat r\u00e1nu, co\u017e ov\u0161em znamen\u00e1, \u017ee ji ani s\u00e1m ned\u00e1.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Existuj\u00ed z\u00e1kladn\u00ed dva typy lid\u00ed: obsahov\u00fd a vizu\u00e1ln\u00ed.\nT\u0159eba j\u00e1 si pamatuju, co kde bylo naps\u00e1no. Kdy\u017e sj\u00ed\u017ed\u00edm web, tak je pro m\u011b ur\u010duj\u00edc\u00ed struktura textu a obsah. V podstat\u011b bych to mohl \u010d\u00edst i v konzoli a bude mi to celkem jedno.\nPak jsou lid\u00e9, kte\u0159\u00ed se orientuj\u00ed na webu dle\u00a0 jeho vzhledu. Pamatuj\u00ed si orientaci podle n\u011bjak\u00fdch obr\u00e1zk\u016f a jin\u00fdch grafick\u00fdch prvk\u016f.\u00a0 Pro m\u011b je to nepochopiteln\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstup, ale lidi tak prost\u011b mysl\u00ed.\nKdy\u017e si t\u0159eba j\u00e1 m\u00e1m n\u011bco zapamatovat, tak si zap\u00ed\u0161u nap\u0159. kategorii, nebo obsahovou strukturu. Kdy\u017e si chce n\u011bco zapamatovat\u00a0 onen vizu\u00e1ln\u00ed typ, tak si p\u00ed\u0161e v\u011bci jako \"vpravo naho\u0159e kliknout na t\u0159i te\u010dky\".\u00a0 Asi tu\u0161\u00edte, jak\u00e9 probl\u00e9my pak nastanou, kdy\u017e dojde i k drobn\u00e9mu redesignu.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Stihl jsem je\u0161t\u011b dovolenou v z\u00e1\u0159\u00ed, tak jsem vzal moje holky na Sn\u011b\u017eku.\u00a0 Nejprve jsme si \u0159\u00edkali, \u017ee s miminem budeme na Sn\u011b\u017ece za exoty, ale nakonec se uk\u00e1zalo, \u017ee mimina na Sn\u011b\u017ece jsou celkem b\u011b\u017en\u00e1. Jen nen\u00ed b\u011b\u017en\u00e9, \u017ee to n\u011bkdo s t\u00edm miminem vy\u0161lape.\u00a0 \u00a0 #SkalnySt\u00f3\u0142\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: => Use Google before asking <=\nNejsem si jist\u00fd, jestli je to ovlivn\u011bn\u00e9 extroverz\u00ed/introverz\u00ed, ale m\u00e1m takov\u00fd pocit, \u017ee introverti v\u00edce hledaj\u00ed, ne\u017e za\u010dnou pokl\u00e1dat ji\u017e d\u00e1vno vy\u0159e\u0161en\u00e9 ot\u00e1zky.\u00a0 A mo\u017en\u00e1 je to lenost a snaha p\u0159esunout \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed probl\u00e9mu na n\u011bkoho jin\u00e9ho.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dnes se mi poda\u0159ilo zase pokro\u010dit v automatizaci reportingu. Ka\u017ed\u00fdm dnem pracuji na tom, aby m\u011b u\u017e nebylo t\u0159eba.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Jak\u00e9 se v\u016fbec stanovuj\u00ed KPI u pr\u00e1ce program\u00e1tora? \u00a0V marketingu jsou moje kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 KPI n\u00e1klady na objedn\u00e1vku a n\u00e1klady na n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvu. \u00a0U pr\u00e1ce program\u00e1tora si n\u011bjak\u00e9 tak jasn\u011b ( = finan\u010dn\u011b) m\u011b\u0159iteln\u00e9 KPI n\u011bjak neum\u00ed vybavit.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: P\u0159i nab\u00eddce pr\u00e1ce v IT by sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed nab\u00eddky m\u011bl b\u00fdt popis hardware, se kter\u00fdm m\u00e1 \u010dlov\u011bk pracovat. Proto\u017ee pracovat s pomal\u00fdm strojem \u00a0je n\u011bco absolutn\u011b demotivuj\u00edc\u00edho.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdysi m\u011b iritovalo, \u017ee firmy hledaj\u00ed \"supermany\", kte\u0159\u00ed um\u00ed SEO, PPC a i soci\u00e1ln\u00ed s\u00edt\u011b. \u00a0Postupn\u011b jsem se dopracoval k tomu, \u017ee jsem se nau\u010dil pracovat s v\u00fd\u0161e uveden\u00fdmi kan\u00e1ly.\nTe\u010f \u010dtu si m\u00edrn\u011b ironick\u00fdm \u00fasm\u011bvem \"st\u00ed\u017enosti\", \u017ee si firmy mysl\u00ed, \u017ee tohle je pr\u00e1ce pro program\u00e1tory, co\u017e je moje budouc\u00ed sm\u011b\u0159ov\u00e1n\u00ed.\nS\u00e1m v\u00edm, \u017ee nikdy nebudu jen program\u00e1tor a nikdy u\u017e nebudu ani jen markt\u00e9r. Budu ten superman, o kter\u00e9m trh sn\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdy\u017e v\u00e1s za\u010dnou druz\u00ed kop\u00edrovat, znamen\u00e1 to, \u017ee jste dob\u0159\u00ed. Pokud se v\u00e1s nikdo nesna\u017e\u00ed napodobit, tak asi nen\u00ed pro\u010d. A to je \u0161patn\u00fd.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Z\u00e1\u0159\u00ed je typick\u00fd m\u011bs\u00edc nov\u00fdch za\u010d\u00e1tk\u016f. Tak co takhle za\u010d\u00edt cvi\u010dit bojov\u00e1 um\u011bn\u00ed? \u00a0Shaolin, Tai Chi a Sanda p\u0159\u00edmo od \u010d\u00ednsk\u00fdch mistr\u016f.\nPokud se rozhodnete pro Sanda, tak budete m\u00edt mo\u017enost si do m\u011b bouchnout \u00a0:) \u00a0 \u00a0#Praha\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Takov\u00e9 to, kdy\u017e hled\u00e1te do t\u00fdmu punk\u00e1\u010de, kter\u00fd vid\u00ed na 10 let dop\u0159edu. To je dobr\u00e9 sci-fi. \u00a0Jedno z hlavn\u00edch hesel punku je toti\u017e \"No future\".\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Te\u010f p\u0159idali nov\u00e9 \u010didlo do \u00falu. Tak\u017ee je dostupn\u00e1 v\u00e1ha, teplota a vlhkost \u00falu.   Hned m\u00e1m dv\u011b mo\u017en\u00e9 hypot\u00e9zy, kter\u00e9 by se daly otestovat.  Monitoring zdrav\u00ed \u00falu a p\u0159edpov\u011b\u010f po\u010das\u00ed / pylov\u00e9 zpravodajstv\u00ed.  Nechcete se n\u011bkdo p\u0159idat?\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: U\u017e p\u0159es rok m\u00e1m zautomatizovan\u00fd reporting. Ned\u00e1vno nastoupil nov\u00fd zam\u011bstnanec a a\u017e ten mi napsal, \u017ee tam m\u00e1m chybu. Te\u010f u\u017e v\u00edm, \u017ee aspo\u0148 jeden \u010dlov\u011bk to doopravdy \u010dte.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: AdWords vysly\u0161elo m\u00e9 prosby a ud\u011blali nov\u00e9 rozhran\u00ed, u kter\u00e9ho nemus\u00edm nekone\u010dn\u011b dlouho \u010dekat, \"ne\u017e se n\u011bco stane\".\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \"kv\u016fli p\u0159echodu na\u0161\u00ed CDN na novou technologii jsme m\u011bnily adresy obr\u00e1zk\u016f\"\nSPR\u00c1VN\u011a: \"z d\u016fvodu zvy\u0161ov\u00e1n\u00ed zabezpe\u010den\u00ed komunikace va\u0161eho webu s na\u0161\u00edm serverem jsme zm\u011bnily adresy obr\u00e1zk\u016f\"\nStarou URL antivir blokuje, proto\u017ee nem\u00e1 platn\u00fd certifik\u00e1t, nov\u00e1 verze projde.\nKdy\u017e n\u011bco chci, tak to mus\u00edm \u0159\u00edct norm\u00e1ln\u011b. U\u017eivateli je jedno, co d\u011bl\u00e1te ve firm\u011b za zm\u011bny. Chce v\u011bd\u011bt, jak se ho to t\u00fdk\u00e1 a co z toho bude m\u00edt.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Zkou\u0161el jsem snad v\u0161echno, abych ze  Zbo\u017e\u00ed z\u00edskal konverzi za rozumn\u00e9 n\u00e1klady. A nic nezabralo.  Je to prost\u011b zabit\u00fd.  A\u0165 d\u011bl\u00e1m co d\u011bl\u00e1m, tak v\u017edy je tam konverze dra\u017e\u0161\u00ed, jak u ostatn\u00edch kan\u00e1l\u016f.  A to jsem optimalizoval feed, co to \u0161lo.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: V\u0161ichni milujeme data, \u017ee jo? Tak se pod\u011bl\u00edm o statistiky jednoho pl\u00e1cnut\u00ed, kter\u00e9 se kupodivu chytlo.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: N\u011bco na tom bude\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Chyst\u00e1m se pov\u011bsit marketing na h\u0159eb\u00edk a za\u010d\u00edt novou kari\u00e9ru jako program\u00e1tor.\nCo m\u011b k tomu vede? Zejm\u00e9na to, \u017ee ka\u017ed\u00fd m\u00e1 pocit, \u017ee rozum\u00ed marketingu a ka\u017ed\u00fd do toho chce kecat, tak\u017ee ve v\u00fdsledku vznikaj\u00ed stra\u0161n\u00e9 spl\u00e1caniny, pod kter\u00e9 se nechci podepisovat.\nProgramov\u00e1n\u00ed m\u00e1 tu v\u00fdhodu, \u017ee je to odborn\u00e1 v\u011bc a u\u017e jsou t\u0159eba odborn\u00e9 znalosti, aby v\u00e1m do toho mohl n\u011bkdo kecat. Tak\u017ee u\u017e n\u011bco mus\u00ed V\u011aD\u011aT.  To je oproti marketingu v\u00fdrazn\u00fd rozd\u00edl.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dnes jsem p\u0159edal v\u00fdpov\u011bd.  Moc radosti z toho nikdo nem\u00e1, ale co se d\u00e1 d\u011blat. \u017divot jde d\u00e1l.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Tak\u00e9 jsem introvert, ale um\u00edm hr\u00e1t i extroverta.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Mozilla, Opera i Chrome um\u00ed zobrazit web t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 stejn\u011b. Jen pro IE je t\u0159eba vlastn\u00ed CSS, proto\u017ee\nMicrosoft\nneum\u00ed ud\u011blat ani prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010d, kter\u00fd funguje dle standard\u016f.  A to je probl\u00e9m, kter\u00fd je zn\u00e1m u\u017e dlouho. Pro\u010d kone\u010dn\u011b neud\u011blaj\u00ed funk\u010dn\u00ed prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010d?\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Gender nejl\u00e9pe pochop\u00edte, kdy\u017e m\u00e1te mal\u00e9 d\u00edt\u011b.\nUkazoval jsem fotku S\u00e1ry s Kori na\u0161\u00ed \u00fa\u010detn\u00ed. Jak ji vid\u011bla, tak o S\u00e1\u0159e za\u010dala mluvit v mu\u017esk\u00e9m rod\u011b. Bylo mi to divn\u00e9, proto\u017ee ona v\u00ed, \u017ee m\u00e1m S\u00e1ru. Vid\u011bla  rodn\u00fd list.\nS\u00e1ra na fotce m\u00e1 gender kluka. Byla ji p\u0159i\u0159azena pru\u017enost a odolnost. Prost\u011b \"kluk jako buk\".\nKdyby m\u011bla r\u016f\u017eov\u00e9 \u0161ati\u010dky, tak by asi z\u00edskala vlastnosti jak roztomil\u00e1, kr\u00e1sn\u00e1, mo\u017en\u00e1 i k\u0159ehk\u00e1.\nTo je gender. A\u017e  S\u00e1ra vyroste, tak bude m\u00edt svobodu b\u00fdt \u010d\u00edmkoliv bude cht\u00edt. Klidn\u011b automechanik, modelka, aj\u0165\u00e1k, mana\u017eerka,  profesion\u00e1ln\u00ed z\u00e1pasnice, nebo policistka. Bude to jej\u00ed volba.  J\u00e1 ji ur\u010dit\u011b nebudu determinovat do \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 \u0161katulky, kter\u00e1 omez\u00ed jej\u00ed profesn\u00ed v\u00fdb\u011br.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: V\nSeznam.cz\nnecht\u011bj\u00ed blokovat weby, kter\u00e9 \u0161\u00ed\u0159\u00ed l\u017ei a protidemokratickou propagandu. Ale j\u00e1 nejsem l\u00ednej, tak si d\u011bl\u00e1m vlastn\u00ed seznam.  U\u017e m\u00e1m 424 blokovan\u00fdch web\u016f.  Trochu m\u00e1m cuk\u00e1n\u00ed, \u017ee bloknu i\nNovinky.cz\n, ale p\u0159em\u00e1h\u00e1m se. Ikdy\u017e je to \u017eumpa \u010desk\u00e9ho internetu, tak i tak tam zat\u00edm nech\u00e1m b\u011b\u017eet kampan\u011b, ale budu to pe\u010dliv\u011b sledovat. Pokud do dvou m\u011bs\u00edc\u016f nebude  lep\u0161\u00ed konverzn\u00ed pom\u011br, kter\u00fd je te\u010f velmi \u0161patn\u00fd, tak i na Novinky dojde.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Tak jsem dnes dal v\u00fdpov\u011b\u010f v Mc TREE.  Od listopadu nastupuju do CN Group.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Chvilku jsem si myslel, \u017ee\nSeznam.cz\nse pou\u010dil od\nGoogle\na  \u017ee se ze Seznamu stane zna\u010dka, kterou m\u016f\u017ee m\u00edt r\u00e1d i \u010dlov\u011bk, kter\u00fd m\u00e1 r\u00e1d pravdu, demokracii a svobodu. Ale ne... Seznam obr\u00e1til a nad\u00e1le bude podporovat dezinforma\u010dn\u00ed weby, kter\u00e9 se sna\u017e\u00ed rozkl\u00e1dat na\u0161\u00ed spole\u010dnost a st\u00e1t. No nic. Seznam prost\u011b je jen dal\u0161\u00ed firma, kter\u00e1 d\u011bl\u00e1 v\u0161echno jen pro prachy. Nen\u00ed to \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd spolek filosof\u016f, ani nejsou \"ti spr\u00e1vn\u00ed\" jako ho\u0161i a kluci z Google. Seznam nem\u00e1 probl\u00e9m \"be devil\". Hlavn\u00ed je, kdy\u017e to sype.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Medi\u00e1ln\u00ed sc\u00e9na prob\u00edr\u00e1 t\u00e9ma, jestli se \u017eeny hod\u00ed na pr\u00e1ci v IT a dokonce se mluv\u00ed i biologick\u00fdch p\u0159edpokladech.  Dle m\u00e9ho n\u00e1zoru je to stejn\u00e9, jako by se n\u011bkdo ptal, jestli v IT m\u016f\u017eou pracovat lev\u00e1ci, homosexu\u00e1lov\u00e9, buddhisti, \u017eidi, nebo \u010derno\u0161i.\nNikomu neup\u00edr\u00e1m pr\u00e1vo na n\u00e1zor, ale je dobr\u00e9 si uv\u011bdomit, \u017ee n\u00e1zor nen\u00ed to stejn\u00e9 jako pravda.  Pokud je pro n\u011bkoho d\u016fle\u017eit\u011bj\u0161\u00ed n\u00e1zor ne\u017e pravda, tak jen dokazuje, \u017ee je l\u00edn\u00fd myslet. A lid\u00e9, kte\u0159\u00ed jsou l\u00edn\u00ed myslet, sice v IT pracovat m\u016f\u017eou, ale budou m\u00edt malou v\u00fdkonnost a d\u011blat zbyte\u010dn\u00e9 chyby.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Sklik vylou\u010d\u00ed z obsahov\u00e9 s\u00edt\u011b  fakenews weby.  J\u00e1 u\u017e je m\u00e1m na sv\u00e9m banlistu ji\u017e dlouho, ale v\u00edt\u00e1m to jako vst\u0159\u00edcn\u00fd krok v\u016f\u010di spr\u00e1vc\u016fm PPC kampan\u00ed, kte\u0159\u00ed si nemus\u00ed vytv\u00e1\u0159et t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 nekone\u010dn\u00e9 seznamy web\u016f, kde fakt necht\u011bj\u00ed b\u00fdt vid\u011bni.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Narodil se n\u00e1m potomek. Tak jsem byl po dlouh\u00e9 dob\u011b p\u0159inucen jednat se st\u00e1tn\u00edmi \u00fa\u0159ady. Je to vrchol naprost\u00e9 neefektivity a pohrd\u00e1n\u00ed z\u00e1kazn\u00edkem.\nM\u00e1m n\u00e1rok na rodi\u010dovsk\u00fd p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek. Na to m\u00e1 n\u00e1rok ka\u017ed\u00fd rodi\u010d. P\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek vyd\u00e1v\u00e1 \u00da\u0159ad pr\u00e1ce, ale ten chce  formul\u00e1\u0159 od \u010cSSZ. Formul\u00e1\u0159 obsahuje jen jedno pol\u00ed\u010dko.  Tak\u017ee j\u00e1 si mus\u00edm vz\u00edt dovolenou, j\u00edt na  \u010cSSZ, nechat si od nich vyplnit to jedno pol\u00ed\u010dko. Pak mus\u00edm vypln\u011bn\u00fd formul\u00e1\u0159 odn\u00e9st na \u00daP. \u017d\u00e1dn\u00e1 elektronick\u00e1 cesta neexistuje. A \u017ee by na \u00daP mrkli do po\u010d\u00edta\u010de a vyplnili si tu jednu blbou kolonku sami? Tak to je teda ani nenapadne.  By brali pr\u00e1ci jin\u00fdm p\u0159\u00ed\u017eivn\u00edk\u016fm = st\u00e1tn\u00edm \u00fa\u0159edn\u00edk\u016fm.\nParadoxn\u011b za tuhle p\u0159ebujelou byrokracii a nep\u0159\u00e1telstv\u00ed st\u00e1tu k ob\u010dan\u016fm m\u016f\u017eou strany, kter\u00e1 jedna tvrd\u00ed, \u017ee chce \u0159\u00eddit st\u00e1t jako firmu a druh\u00e1, \u017ee podporuje rodiny.  Ob\u011b strany l\u017eou.  V\u00fdsledek fungov\u00e1n\u00ed st\u00e1tn\u00ed spr\u00e1vy sv\u011bd\u010d\u00ed o prav\u00e9m opaku.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Docela \u010dasto \u010dtu, jak n\u011bkde nab\u00edraj\u00ed  headhuntery na lovce aj\u0165\u00e1k\u016f.  P\u0159itom dle reakc\u00ed v\u00edm, \u017ee tito lovci \u010dasto IT moc nerozum\u00ed.  Projdou n\u011bjak\u00fdm \u0161kolen\u00edm, ale prost\u011b nejsou to aj\u0165\u00e1ci. Nerozum\u00ed na\u0161\u00ed \u0159e\u010di, ani my\u0161len\u00ed.  Nebylo by rozumn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed d\u00e1t n\u011bjak\u00e9 \"n\u00e1lezn\u00e9\" skute\u010dn\u00fdm aj\u0165\u00e1k\u016fm, kte\u0159\u00ed doporu\u010d\u00ed sv\u00e9 kolegy, o kter\u00fdch v\u00ed, \u017ee doopravdy rozum\u00ed sv\u00e9 pr\u00e1ci a jsou ochotni zm\u011bnit zam\u011bstn\u00e1n\u00ed?\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Pr\u00fd je okurkov\u00e1 sez\u00f3na. Jen\u017ee kdy\u017e prod\u00e1v\u00e1te ledni\u010dky, tak pr\u00e1v\u011b te\u010f je velmi zaj\u00edmav\u00e9 obdob\u00ed. Ledni\u010dky se nejv\u00edce prod\u00e1vaj\u00ed v l\u00e9t\u011b a mrazni\u010dky na podzim.  \u010c\u00edm v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed teplo, t\u00edm lep\u0161\u00ed prodeje.\nJak je zn\u00e1mo, tak ledni\u010dky maj\u00ed r\u016fzn\u00e9 klimatick\u00e9 t\u0159\u00eddy a vysok\u00e9 teploty snadno ledni\u010dku s ni\u017e\u0161\u00ed klimatickou t\u0159\u00eddou \"odp\u00e1l\u00ed\". A kdo by cht\u011bl  b\u00fdt v l\u00e9t\u011b bez ledni\u010dky, \u017ee jo?\nA mrazni\u010dky a podzim? Jednoduch\u00e9: sklid\u00edte ze zahr\u00e1dky a co pak s t\u00edm? Najednou zjist\u00edte, \u017ee pot\u0159ebujete v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed mraz\u00e1k, proto\u017ee ten v\u00e1\u0161 mal\u00fd mraz\u00e1\u010dek u\u017e je p\u0159ecpan\u00fd.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Mezi m\u00e9 speci\u00e1ln\u00ed schopnosti pat\u0159\u00ed pt\u00e1t se na naprosto jasn\u00e9 v\u011bci, kter\u00e9 v\u0161ichni d\u00e1vno znaj\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kter\u00e1 nab\u00eddka nepat\u0159\u00ed do seznamu?  V\u00fdsledky sout\u011b\u017ee zas\u00edlejte na\nPricemania\n-\nhttps://lnkd.in/gBuTJCb\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Narazil jsem na zaj\u00edmav\u00e9 t\u00e9ma: talent.  Je talent d\u016fle\u017eit\u00fd?   Dle m\u00e9ho n\u00e1zoru nen\u00ed.\nTalent m\u016f\u017ee usnadnit pr\u00e1ci, ale s\u00e1m o sob\u011b je bezcenn\u00fd.  Potkal jsem u\u017e dost talentovan\u00fdch lid\u00ed, kter\u00fdm chyb\u011bla vytrvalost, c\u00edlev\u011bdomost a pracovitost.  Pokud tohle nem\u00e1te, tak je v\u00e1m talent k ni\u010demu.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Zaj\u00edmalo by m\u011b, pro\u010d maj\u00ed \u010ce\u0161i tak malou ochotu cestovat za prac\u00ed. Nevolnictv\u00ed bylo zru\u0161eno ji\u017e v roce  1781. To nem\u016f\u017ee tak dlouho trvat si zvyknout na nov\u00fd stav v\u011bc\u00ed.\nSamoz\u0159ejm\u011b, \u017ee i j\u00e1 bych bral pr\u00e1ci pobl\u00ed\u017e domova, ale to je jen ot\u00e1zka pohodlnosti.  A co si budeme vykl\u00e1dat, kdy\u017e existuje motivace, tak \u010dlov\u011bk trochu toho nepohodl\u00ed vydr\u017e\u00ed.  Lokalitu pr\u00e1ce pova\u017euju jen za stanoven\u00ed komfortn\u00ed z\u00f3ny.  Pak u\u017e  je jen na zam\u011bstnavateli, jak m\u011b bude motivovat, abych se p\u0159est\u011bhoval do Brna, Bratislavy, nebo na Bali :))).\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Pricemania ud\u011blala redesign j\u00e1 m\u016f\u017eu p\u0159epsat scraper  :/\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: V\u016fbec nech\u00e1pu, jak NEfunguje p\u00e1rovac\u00ed n\u00e1stoj na\nZbozi.cz\n.  Shoda v n\u00e1zvu i EANu, ale stejn\u011b to nedok\u00e1\u017e\u00ed nap\u00e1rovat. Co je na tom tak t\u011b\u017ek\u00e9ho?\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dnes d\u011bl\u00e1 marketing kde kdo. Jen\u017ee je to takov\u00fd instantn\u00ed marketing.  To je po\u0159\u00e1d: \"pot\u0159ebujete blog,  soci\u00e1ln\u00ed s\u00edt\u011b, eshop,  PPC, SEO\". Bla, bla, bla.  Rady padaj\u00ed jedna za druhou, ale tihle \"experti\" se z n\u011bjak\u00e9ho d\u016fvodu neobt\u011b\u017euj\u00ed pochopit, co je t\u011b\u017ei\u0161t\u011b podnik\u00e1n\u00ed, komu a co prod\u00e1v\u00e1te a pro\u010d to prod\u00e1v\u00e1te. Univerz\u00e1ln\u00ed rady pro univerz\u00e1ln\u00ed produkt, kter\u00fd u\u010din\u00ed  v\u00e1\u0161 marketing naprosto neefektivn\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u017de mi scanuj\u00ed web hacke\u0159i z cel\u00e9ho sv\u011bta jsem si u\u017e zvykl. Dnes r\u00e1no kouk\u00e1m do log\u016f a hle.. CZ.NIC mi  hled\u00e1 administr\u00e1torsk\u00e9 rozhran\u00ed.  Tak\u017ee CZ.NIC m\u00e1 u m\u011b ban.   Nebudu d\u011blat vyj\u00edmku. Ka\u017ed\u00fd, kdo se mi chce vloupat do webu, dost\u00e1v\u00e1 ban.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: M\u00e9 hlavn\u00ed c\u00edle v McTREE byly dosa\u017eeny.  Co \u0161lo, to jsem zautomatizoval, spustil novou verzi eshopu.  Z\u00e1rove\u0148 se mi narodil potomek. Na cest\u011b do pr\u00e1ce nech\u00e1v\u00e1m t\u0159i hodiny denn\u011b. To se mus\u00ed zm\u011bnit.  Tak\u017ee nastal \u010das poohl\u00e9dnout se po pr\u00e1ci n\u011bkde bl\u00ed\u017ee k domovu.  #SEO #ecommerce #datascience #Praha\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Google Adwords m\u00e1 nesmysln\u00e9 po\u017eadavky na velikost p\u00edsmen. Produkt Lieberr EWTgw 3583 se prost\u011b tak jmenuje. J\u00e1 si to nevymyslel. Rozli\u0161ov\u00e1n\u00ed velk\u00fdch a mal\u00fd p\u00edsmen tam m\u00e1 v\u00fdznam. Jen\u017ee to by musel N\u011aKDO p\u0159em\u00fd\u0161let a ned\u011blat jen automatick\u00e9 posuzov\u00e1n\u00ed reklam, co\u017e je asi pro lidi\nGoogle\nprobl\u00e9m.  Nemluv\u011b o tom, \u017ee zna\u010dka LIEBHERR se m\u00e1 ps\u00e1t velk\u00fdmi p\u00edsmeny, proto\u017ee je to prost\u011b brand.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u010clov\u011bk si snadno zvykne na automatizaci. Nev\u00fdhodou tohoto jevu je, \u017ee kdy\u017e p\u0159estane fungovat ppcHIT, tak mus\u00edte ru\u010dn\u011b d\u011blat pr\u00e1ci, kterou maj\u00ed d\u011blat stroje, co\u017e  stimuluje endokrinn\u00ed syst\u00e9m a v\u00e1s pak napadaj\u00ed nehezk\u00e1 slova.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kone\u010dn\u011b se mi poda\u0159ilo spustit novou verzi\nMcTREE.cz\n.  To nejhor\u0161\u00ed u\u017e m\u00e1m za sebou, ale st\u00e1le je na tom pr\u00e1ce jak na kostele.\nhttp://bit.ly/2rVn1uY\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: A\u010d m\u00e1m v\u016f\u010di Seznamu \u010dasto d\u016frazn\u00e9 p\u0159ipom\u00ednky, tak Sklik v u\u017eivatelsk\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edv\u011btivosti je o  100% lep\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e AdWords.  AdWords je jedna velk\u00e1 chyba.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Na Novinky(dot)cz p\u00ed\u0161ou, jak chlap uml\u00e1til holku ty\u010d\u00ed. V diskuz\u00edch to l\u016fza chv\u00e1l\u00ed. Spr\u00e1vce Novinek to nema\u017ee.  Novinky pat\u0159\u00ed Seznamu. To je d\u016fvod, pro\u010d bych v Seznamu pracovat nemohl. Nep\u0159ekousl bych, \u017ee pracuju pro spole\u010dnost, kter\u00e1 toleruje schvalov\u00e1n\u00ed n\u00e1sil\u00ed.  Dost se div\u00edm, \u017ee to zam\u011bstnanc\u016fm Seznamu nevad\u00ed. J\u00e1 bych se fakt hanbou propadl.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u010clov\u011bk VS gener\u00e1tor n\u00e1hodn\u00fdch URL.\nZat\u00edm dost\u00e1v\u00e1m p\u011bkn\u011b na frak, ale optimisticky douf\u00e1m, \u017ee to jednou vyhraju.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kter\u00e1 zkratka nepat\u0159\u00ed do skupiny?\nAI, UI, BI, CI\n// tohle by mohli pou\u017e\u00edvat HR p\u0159i n\u00e1boru  :)\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dnes zapo\u010dal proces p\u0159esunu eshopu\nMcTREE.cz\nna novou verzi.  Trochu tr\u00e9ma.  Aby toho nebylo dost, tak moje \u017eena bude s nejv\u011bt\u0161\u00ed pravd\u011bpodobnost\u00ed dnes rodit.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Flamewar - linkbuilding snadno a rychle\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Co d\u011bl\u00e1m po pr\u00e1ci? T\u0159eba chod\u00edm ven\u010dit draka :)\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Google Data Studio je fajn, ale  chyb\u00ed tam modus. Modus pova\u017euju za velmi d\u016fle\u017eitou metriku. Nech\u00e1pu, pro\u010d je tak systematicky p\u0159ehl\u00ed\u017een.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: P\u0159esn\u011b tohle jsem pot\u0159eboval.  Google Data Studio.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Google m\u00e1 dostat pokutu od EP za  nadm\u011brnou prot\u011b\u017eov\u00e1n\u00ed Google N\u00e1kupy ve vyhled\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed. Tak to jsem zv\u011bd\u011bv, kdy dostane pokutu Seznam. D\u011bl\u00e1 \u00fapln\u011b to stejn\u00e9.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Prvn\u00ed zku\u0161enost s\nNordic Telecom\nNap\u00ed\u0161u jim na chat, jestli m\u011b dok\u00e1\u017e\u00ed p\u0159ipojit na net a zad\u00e1m adresu. Odpov\u00ed, \u017ee m\u00e1m zavolat. Pro\u010d maj\u00ed chat, kdy\u017e na n\u011bm neum\u00ed odpov\u011bd\u011bt na dotazy z\u00e1kazn\u00edk\u016f? o.O\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: O anomii jsem se u\u010dil ve \u0161kole, ale doufal, \u017ee to neza\u017eiju. Omyl. \u017dijeme v dob\u011b, kdy kr\u00e1de\u017ee, lhan\u00ed a zab\u00edjen\u00ed d\u011blaj\u00ed z lid\u00ed hrdiny, zat\u00edmco pravda a l\u00e1ska jsou pova\u017eov\u00e1ny za nad\u00e1vky.  U\u017e del\u0161\u00ed dobu uva\u017euju, \u017ee to v \u010cR zabal\u00edm.  To\u017e kdybyste pot\u0159ebovali specialistu e-commerce t\u0159eba v Kanad\u011b, nebo na Bali, tak tady jsem :).\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Eshop\nLevnoElektro.cz\nu\u017e rok nefunguje a st\u00e1le je Google zobrazuje ve v\u00fdsledc\u00edch serp, p\u0159esto\u017ee po kliknut\u00ed na odkaz dostanete E404.\nGoogle\nnen\u00ed zas tak dobr\u00fd vyhled\u00e1va\u010d, jak se tvrd\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \"Someone at Medi\u00e1ln\u00ed skupina MAFRA viewed your profile \"  - \u017ee bych to trollen\u00edm Babi\u0161e u\u017e p\u0159eh\u00e1n\u011bl? :D\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Za\u010dal jsem poslouchat, co lidi \u0159\u00edkaj\u00ed o sv\u00e9 pr\u00e1ci. Snad ka\u017ed\u00fd \u010dlov\u011bk si st\u011b\u017eoval, \u017ee to je u nich \"Kocourkov\". Lidi p\u0159et\u00ed\u017een\u00ed a demotivovan\u00ed. A to jsem se ptal lid\u00ed z r\u016fzn\u00fdch profes\u00ed a r\u016fzn\u00fdch segment\u016f trhu.  Je\u0161t\u011b nev\u00edm, jestli je to n\u011bjak\u00fd znak \u010desk\u00e9ho pracovn\u00edho trhu, nebo to tak je v\u0161ude, ale ka\u017edop\u00e1dn\u011b je to \u010dasto se opakuj\u00edc\u00ed jev.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdyby se lidi v\u00edce \u0159\u00eddili daty, tak by bylo na sv\u011bt\u011b l\u00e9pe. Emoce a dojmy zkresluj\u00ed skute\u010dnost a vedou tak ke \u0161patn\u00fdm rozhodnut\u00edm.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Jsou r\u016fzn\u00e9 stupn\u011b a podstupn\u011b  po\u010d\u00edta\u010dov\u00e9 gramotnosti. J\u00e1 o sob\u011b mluv\u00edm jako o PHP gramotn\u00e9m.  Co to zna\u010d\u00ed?  Definuju to jako schopnost \u010d\u00edst, porozum\u011bt a ps\u00e1t PHP k\u00f3d. To ov\u0161em ze m\u011b ned\u011bl\u00e1 program\u00e1tora. Stejn\u011b jako schopnost \u010d\u00edst a ps\u00e1t z nikoho ned\u011bl\u00e1 spisovatele, \u010di b\u00e1sn\u00edka.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kam te\u010de nejv\u00edce \"neziskov\u00fdch\" pen\u011bz?\nPozor! Obsahuje interaktivn\u00ed kol\u00e1\u010dov\u00fd graf ;)\nhttps://lnkd.in/gkeA59g\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dnes jsem byl na sch\u016fzce v centr\u00e1le Heureky. Dozv\u011bd\u011bl jsem se dal\u0161\u00ed zaj\u00edmavosti o tom, jak Heureka funguje. Tak jsem zv\u011bdav, kolik z toho dok\u00e1\u017eu vyt\u011b\u017eit pro n\u00e1\u0161 marketing.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: M\u011bl by pod\u0159\u00edzen\u00fd kontrolovat v\u00fdstup od sv\u00e9ho nad\u0159\u00edzen\u00e9ho?\nJ\u00e1 to d\u011bl\u00e1m. Ka\u017ed\u00fd d\u011bl\u00e1 chyby, tak\u017ee si v\u017edy zkontroluju data i od sv\u00e9ho \u0161\u00e9fa. Na druhou stranu kolega byl zd\u011b\u0161en, kdy\u017e jsem mu \u0159ekl, aby si data, kter\u00e1 dostal od \u0161\u00e9fa, p\u0159ekontroloval. P\u0159i\u0161lo mu nep\u0159\u00edpustn\u00e9, aby kontroloval sv\u00e9ho \u0161\u00e9fa.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Chyba je stavebn\u00ed k\u00e1men v\u00fdvoje. Kdo nic ned\u011bl\u00e1, nic nezkaz\u00ed, ale tak\u00e9 se v ni\u010dem nezlep\u0161\u00ed.\nKonzervativn\u00ed populace samoz\u0159ejm\u011b v\u017edy bude nostalgicky vzpom\u00ednat na star\u00e9 dobr\u00e9 \u010dasy, kdy \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 chyby neexistovaly. Produkty byly dokonal\u00e9, nezni\u010diteln\u00e9.\nTrh ov\u0161em \u017e\u00e1d\u00e1 inovace. Dnes u\u017e nen\u00ed d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e9 m\u00edt dokonal\u00fd produkt, ale je d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e9, aby to byl produkt, kter\u00fd uspokojuje pot\u0159eby sv\u00fdch u\u017eivatel\u016f. Ti cht\u011bj\u00ed j\u00edt s dobou.  A ta je hektick\u00e1, pln\u00e1 zm\u011bn, neust\u00e1l\u00e9ho v\u00fdvoje a samoz\u0159ejm\u011b i chyb.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u010cS\u00da m\u00e1 ve\u0159ejnou datab\u00e1zi, kde si m\u016f\u017eete nastavit vlastn\u00ed v\u00fdb\u011br dat.  Mal\u00fd krok pro \u010cS\u00da, velk\u00fd krok pro lidstvo!\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1te FTP ke spr\u00e1v\u011b webu?  FTP nen\u00ed zabezpe\u010den\u00fd protokol, proto jde odposlouch\u00e1vat. A kdy\u017e odposlechnu hesla, tak do 5 minut jsem admin webu.\nPro bezpe\u010dnou pr\u00e1ci se soubory je lep\u0161\u00ed pou\u0161\u00edt SFTP, nebo ssh.\n\nMetadata: 7 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u010casto sly\u0161\u00edm, \u017ee \"je rychlej\u0161\u00ed si zavolat, ne\u017e n\u011bco vysv\u011btlovat do emailu\".  T\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 v\u017edy to sly\u0161\u00edm od lid\u00ed, kte\u0159\u00ed neum\u00ed formulovat sv\u00e9 my\u0161lenky, tak\u017ee 10 minut \u0159\u00edkaj\u00ed n\u011bco, co lze napsat jednou v\u011btou.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: V\u017edy, kdy\u017e n\u011bkdo nap\u00ed\u0161e do title \u00davod, B\u016fh zabije ko\u0165\u00e1tko.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdy\u017e d\u011bl\u00e1te e-commerce, tak mus\u00edte nakupovat online. Za\u017e\u00edt si ten pocit, kdy si n\u011bco objedn\u00e1te, ale nev\u00edte, kdy a v jak\u00e9m stavu to doraz\u00ed, nebo jak\u00e9 to je, kdy\u017e si \u010dlov\u011bk p\u00ed\u0161e jen s automaty, ale \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd \u010dlov\u011bk mu nenap\u00ed\u0161e odpov\u011b\u010f na jeho dotazy.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Na\u0161e \u0161kolstv\u00ed u\u010dinilo velk\u00fd pokrok. V\u011bt\u0161ina populace um\u00ed \u010d\u00edst! Te\u010f u\u017e jen poko\u0159it druh\u00fd level: nau\u010dit se pochopit psan\u00fd text.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: To, \u017ee n\u011bkdo  um\u00ed \u010d\u00edst a ps\u00e1t v PHP, je\u0161t\u011b neznamen\u00e1, \u017ee je to program\u00e1tor.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Zku\u0161ebn\u011b jsem otestoval, zda u\u017e\nZbozi.cz\nza\u010dalo zakl\u00e1dat nov\u00e9 produkty.  Neza\u010dalo.  V\u0161e p\u0159i star\u00e9m.  A to je velk\u00fd rozd\u00edl oproti Heurece. Ta zalo\u017e\u00ed produkt hned a \u010dlov\u011bk se nemus\u00ed o nic starat. Na\nZbozi.cz\nje upozorn\u00edte na nov\u00fd produkt, po\u0161lete data, ale stejn\u011b to nezalo\u017e\u00ed, proto\u017ee bagr.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: LinkedIn m\u00e1 te\u010f chatovac\u00ed box\u00edk, kter\u00fd vypad\u00e1 jako ten na Facebooku. M\u00e1m z toho takov\u00fd pocit, \u017ee LinkedIn trochu uj\u00ed\u017ed\u00ed od sv\u00e9ho zam\u011b\u0159en\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Konspira\u010dn\u00edm teori\u00edm v\u011b\u0159\u00ed jen hloup\u00ed lid\u00e9 a ti jsou vesm\u011bs chud\u00ed. Vznikla konspirace proti na\u0161\u00ed firm\u011b. V\u00fdsledek je ten, \u017ee se zv\u00fd\u0161ila pr\u016fm\u011brn\u00e1 cena objedn\u00e1vky.  To\u017e pro\u010d ne...\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Nez\u00e1vislost novin\u00e1\u0159\u016f, v\u010detn\u011b t\u011bch \"nez\u00e1visl\u00fdch\", je jen iluze.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: J\u00e1 to\nZbozi.cz\nnech\u00e1pu. V p\u00e1rovac\u00edm n\u00e1stroji to tvrd\u00ed, \u017ee produkt neum\u00ed sp\u00e1rovat. A v detailu produktu za\nZbozi.cz\nm\u00e1me eshop vypsan\u00fd.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Z\u00e1kladn\u00ed probl\u00e9m se SEO je v tom, \u017ee lidi maj\u00ed pocit, \u017ee to je n\u011bco d\u011bsn\u011b slo\u017eit\u00e9ho.  Ve skute\u010dnosti tomu tak nen\u00ed. SEO je v podstat\u011b jednoduch\u00e1 z\u00e1le\u017eitost. Lidi si to jen \u00famysln\u011b komplikuj\u00ed, proto\u017ee po\u0159\u00e1d p\u0159em\u00fd\u0161l\u00ed, jak vyhled\u00e1va\u010d ochcat, m\u00edsto aby p\u0159em\u00fd\u0161leli, jak vytvo\u0159it ten nejlep\u0161\u00ed v\u00fdsledek pro ur\u010dit\u00e9 dotazy.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Firefox p\u0159estal zobrazovat XML tagy. Pro\u010d?  XML soubory bez tag\u016f jsou ne\u010diteln\u00e9.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: \u010clov\u011bk by si i pomyslel, \u017ee o SEO musel \u010d\u00edst ka\u017ed\u00fd \u010dlov\u011bk, kter\u00fd d\u011bl\u00e1 weby. P\u0159esto na webech st\u00e1le \u010dtu \"klikn\u011bte zde\".\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Excel pat\u0159\u00ed mezi nejz\u00e1kladn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9 programy. O to v\u00edce je zar\u00e1\u017eej\u00edc\u00ed, \u017ee s n\u00edm neum\u00ed pracovat ani absolventi V\u0160 \u0161kol.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Je neuv\u011b\u0159iteln\u00e9, co lidi v\u0161echno dok\u00e1\u017e\u00ed vymysleta a \u010demu v\u0161emu  dok\u00e1\u017e\u00ed v\u011b\u0159it.\nGoogle p\u0159ed rokem p\u0159estal zobrazovat PageRank. Nepova\u017eoval to za p\u0159\u00ednos. Sp\u00ed\u0161e to \u0161kodilo. A co na to SEO \u0161amani?  P\u0159i\u0161li s tvrzen\u00edm, \u017ee PageRank zak\u00e1zala EU. #lol  Dnes lidi p\u0159ekrout\u00ed i sebeban\u00e1ln\u011bj\u0161\u00ed v\u011bc. A nejhor\u0161\u00ed na tom je, \u017ee klidn\u011b \u0161\u00ed\u0159\u00ed takov\u00e9 nesmysly a v\u016fbec se nad t\u00edm nepozastav\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dost \u010dasto \u010dtu o UX ve vztahu k z\u00e1kazn\u00edkovi. Stejn\u011b d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e9 je UX administrace eshopu.  Eshopy kolikr\u00e1t maj\u00ed spoustu fajn funkc\u00ed, ale spr\u00e1vci je neum\u00ed pou\u017e\u00edvat a v\u00fdsledek je \u0161\u00edlen\u00fd gul\u00e1\u0161.  Co\u017e m\u00e1 za n\u00e1sledek nekvalitn\u00ed obsah eshopu a tud\u00ed\u017e i \u0161patn\u00e9 SEO.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: POZOR: specialista e-commerce hled\u00e1 nov\u00fd projekt\nOd \u010dervna bych cht\u011bl za\u010d\u00edt pracovat na nov\u00e9m eshopu. Tak\u017ee kdybyste hledali \u0161ikovn\u00e9ho multifunk\u010dn\u00edho \u010dlov\u011bka, kter\u00fd se specializuje na eshopy, tak jsem jedno ucho.  Je\u0161t\u011b chci dod\u011blat st\u00e1vaj\u00edc\u00ed projekt, proto d\u0159\u00edve to asi nep\u016fjde.\nPS:  Rozhoduje plat, v\u00fdkonn\u00e1 pracovn\u00ed stanice a mo\u017enost d\u011blat na velk\u00fdch projektech.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Mus\u00edm si d\u00e1vat na Google #Adwords v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed pozor. Dobito 50 euro, kampan\u011b st\u00e1ly 3,09 \u20ac. Z\u016fstatek  \u00fa\u010dtu 10,50 \u20ac.  Tuhle matematiku ch\u00e1pou snad jen v\nGoogle\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Edited \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: P\u0159i p\u0159ekladu web\u016f se v praxi \u010dasto postupuje tak, \u017ee se texty exportuj\u00ed do Excelu a p\u0159edaj\u00ed p\u0159ekladateli. Tak se to d\u011bl\u00e1 a tak je to \u0161patn\u011b. P\u0159ekladatel toti\u017e nikdy nevid\u00ed kontext obsahu na webu. V\u00fdsledky jsou nesmysln\u00e9 p\u0159eklady.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Nech\u00e1pu, pro\u010d m\u00e1\nZbozi.cz\nprobl\u00e9m sp\u00e1rovat produkty, kter\u00e9 maj\u00ed  zcela stejn\u00fd n\u00e1zev jako ji\u017e zalo\u017een\u00fd produkt. Kdy\u017e se produkt jmenuje \u00fapln\u011b stejn\u011b, tak je velmi vysok\u00e1 pravd\u011bpodobnost, \u017ee je to tent\u00fd\u017e produkt. Co\u017e je snad ka\u017ed\u00e9mu jasn\u00e9...\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: M\u00e1me nov\u00e9 LinkedIn. Design ne\u0159e\u0161\u00edm. Pro m\u011b je d\u016fle\u017eit\u00fd v\u00fdkon. A nov\u00e9 LinkedIn je znateln\u011b pomalej\u0161\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Internet je pln\u00fd spamu. Spam m\u00e1 mnoho podob. Nejsou to jen emaily, ale tak\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky v diskuz\u00edch a \u010dl\u00e1nky.  Byla by zaj\u00edmav\u00e1 studie, kter\u00e1 by spo\u010d\u00edtala % skute\u010dn\u011b p\u0159\u00ednosn\u00e9ho obsahu na internetu.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Klienti ABC \u010desk\u00e9ho hospod\u00e1\u0159stv\u00ed se c\u00edt\u00ed podvedeni. J\u00e1 jsem jim na tu nab\u00eddku ani nek\u00fdvl. Jak mi n\u011bkdo nab\u00edz\u00ed prvn\u00ed pozice \"na internetu\" a jin\u00e9 nesmysly, tak hned zpozorn\u00edm a stav\u00edm barik\u00e1dy.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: V\u017edy,kdy\u017e \u010dtu, jak n\u011bjak\u00fd \"market\u00e9r\" prod\u00e1v\u00e1 sv\u00e9 \"tajn\u00e9 triky\", tak si \u0159eknu: dal\u0161\u00ed \u0161arlat\u00e1n.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Jako firemn\u00ed benefit by m\u011bly b\u00fdt ud\u00e1v\u00e1ny parametry stroje, na kter\u00e9m bude muset \u010dlov\u011bk pracovat.  Dlouhou dovolenou pot\u0159ebujete, kdy\u017e m\u00e1te v pr\u00e1ci \u0161unku, na kterou v\u011b\u010dn\u011b mus\u00edte \u010dekat a prakticky se s n\u00ed ned\u00e1 pracovat. Pak je jasn\u00e9, \u017ee v\u00e1s to v pr\u00e1ci \u0161tve. Kdy\u017e m\u00e1 \u010dlov\u011bk nadupan\u00fd stroj, tak ho pr\u00e1ce automaticky bav\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Z\u00e1kladn\u00ed probl\u00e9m HR v IT je v tom, \u017ee se sna\u017e\u00ed naj\u00edt lidi, kter\u00fdm nerozum\u00ed a ani nemluv\u00ed stejn\u00fdm jazykem.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Mnoho lid\u00ed d\u011bl\u00e1 tu chybu, \u017ee se sna\u017e\u00ed sh\u00e1n\u011bt odkazy a zapom\u00ednaj\u00ed na kultivaci sv\u00e9ho webu. J\u00e1 prosazuju cestu obsahu. Kdy\u017e budu m\u00edt dobr\u00fd obsah, lidi budu odkazovat sami od sebe. Proto\u017ee bude na co...\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Zn\u00e1te n\u011bjak\u00fd n\u00e1stroj pro regresn\u00ed anal\u00fdzu spot\u0159ebn\u00edho chov\u00e1n\u00ed?\nJde mi o to, aby se na eshopu zobrazovala hl\u00e1\u0161ka: \"Tyto produkty by v\u00e1s mohly zaj\u00edmat\" a u toho vypsan\u00e9 produkty vybran\u00e9 na m\u00edru dle sociodemografick\u00fdch \u00fadaj\u016f u\u017eivatele.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: A sout\u011b\u017e o nejpomalej\u0161\u00ed srovn\u00e1va\u010d zbo\u017e\u00ed vyhr\u00e1v\u00e1... Chvilka nap\u011bt\u00ed. Ano, je to\nPricemania\n! Gratulujeme pomal\u00e9mu v\u00fdherci.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Refine je dobr\u00e9 na \u010di\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed dat, ale to je asi tak v\u0161e. Pro pr\u00e1ci s daty rad\u011bji pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1m MySQL. Oproti Refine toti\u017e funguje rychle a kdy\u017e n\u011bco neum\u00ed sp\u00e1rovat, tak se ozve.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kter\u00e1 n\u00e1doba se napln\u00ed jako prvn\u00ed?\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: N\u00e1zev firmy psan\u00fd velk\u00fdmi p\u00edsmeny m\u00e1 jako brand v\u00e1\u017en\u00fd probl\u00e9m s PPC reklamou. AdWords usilovn\u011b odm\u00edt\u00e1 velk\u00e1 p\u00edsmena v reklam\u011b. Tak\u017ee si mus\u00edte kazit image brandu a ps\u00e1t n\u00e1zev pouze s prvn\u00edm velk\u00fdm p\u00edsmenem.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Internalization of entity_load query\nI am using Taxonomy Formatter for multilingual website. Taxonomy term is loaded by entity_load().  Is can\u00b4t find how get translated term name. I could translate it directly in translation interface, but it isn\u00b4t conceptual approach. All others term I have translated by Taxonomy translation module.\nSo do you know how customize this code?\nforeach ($items as $delta => $item) {\n$termid = $item['tid'];\n$term[] = $termid;\n$actterm = entity_load('taxonomy_term', $term);\nif(isset($actterm[$termid])) {\n$uri = entity_uri('taxonomy_term', $actterm[$termid]);\nif ($settings['links_option']) {\n$formatted .= $elementwrap[0] . l($actterm[$termid]->name, $uri['path'], $uri['options']) . $elementwrap[1] . $separator;\n}\nelse {\n$formatted .= $elementwrap[0] . check_plain($actterm[$termid]->name) . $elementwrap[1] . $separator;\n}\n}\n}\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Only visible to members of Drupal User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Ono se \u0159ekne \u0159\u00eddit st\u00e1t jako firmu, ale pak to je divn\u00e1 firma, kdy\u017e byrokracii pov\u00fd\u0161\u00edte nad zisk. Skute\u010dn\u00e1 firma se m\u00e1 zab\u00fdvat vyd\u011bl\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00edm pen\u011bz, ne vystavov\u00e1n\u00edm \u00fa\u010dtenek.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Ob\u010das se mi st\u00e1v\u00e1, \u017ee mi nejde vy\u0159e\u0161it n\u011bjak\u00fd probl\u00e9m. Tak to nech\u00e1m na p\u0159\u00ed\u0161t\u00ed den. Pak p\u0159\u00edjdu, kouknu na to a vy\u0159e\u0161\u00edm to. V\u0161e se d\u00e1 vy\u0159e\u0161it, ale ne v\u017edy je na to vhodn\u00e9 rozpolo\u017een\u00ed mysli.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdy\u017e z\u00e1kazn\u00edk nerozum\u00ed \u0159e\u010di va\u0161eho kmene, je t\u0159eba informaci p\u0159eformulovat, ikdy\u017e pak p\u016fsob\u00edte jako trubka.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Lidl \u010cesk\u00e1 republika\nsi dovolil d\u00e1t do inzer\u00e1tu modela \u010dern\u00e9 pleti. Tak se do Lidlu pustili neonacist\u00e9 z Iv\u010cRN. U\u017e tam pr\u00fd nebudou chodit nakupovat... Lidl na to reaguje dob\u0159e. Stoj\u00ed si za t\u00edm, \u017ee rasismus nen\u00ed sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed hodnot Lidlu.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Nefunguje ppcHIT v\u0161em, nebo to nefunguje jen u m\u011b?\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdy\u017e odes\u00edl\u00e1m hromadn\u00e9 emaily, tak m\u00e1m u toho pocit, jako bych obsluhoval zbra\u0148 hromadn\u00e9ho ni\u010den\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: U\u017e p\u0159ed t\u00fddnem mi byla doporu\u010dena aplikace, kter\u00e1 m\u011bla b\u00fdt spu\u0161t\u011bna a\u017e v\u010dera. Sice nech\u00e1pu tohle \"odpo\u010d\u00edt\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed\" a hlavn\u011b d\u011bl\u00e1n\u00ed reklamy na web, kter\u00fd jen \"odpo\u010d\u00edt\u00e1v\u00e1 start\", ale dejme tomu..  Web slavnostn\u011b spu\u0161t\u011bn, ale inzerovan\u00e1 aplikace na n\u011bm nen\u00ed. Jen sam\u00e9 kecy o n\u00ed, ale nikde \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd odkaz na sta\u017een\u00ed. Si snad ze m\u011b d\u011blaj\u00ed srandu. Pro\u010d inzeruj\u00ed n\u011bco, k \u010demu se nen\u00ed mo\u017en\u00e9 dostat?\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: M\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt z horn\u00edka webmaster? M\u016f\u017ee... HTML a CSS se \u010dlov\u011bk nau\u010d\u00ed za dva m\u011bs\u00edce. PHP a SQL se d\u00e1 zvl\u00e1dnout za rok. Mn\u011b se pr\u00e1v\u011b na IT l\u00edb\u00ed, \u017ee je jedno kdo jste, odkud p\u0159ich\u00e1z\u00edte, co jste studovali. Z\u00e1le\u017e\u00ed jen na tom, co um\u00edte a jak rychle se u\u010d\u00edte.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Pr\u00e1v\u011b mi p\u0159i\u0161lo potvrzen\u00ed z Alzy, \u017ee si m\u016f\u017eu vyzvednut telefon, kter\u00fd jsem minulou sobotu objedn\u00e1val.. Bude p\u0159ipraven ji\u017e tuto ned\u011bli! Jen t\u00fdden a den na produkt skladem... Bohu\u017eel Alza m\u00e1 sm\u016flu. My pozem\u0161\u0165an\u00e9 chceme produkty skladem do dvou, maxim\u00e1ln\u011b t\u0159\u00ed dn\u016f, nejl\u00e9pe hned.. Tak\u017ee mobil u\u017e m\u00e1m d\u00e1vno doma. Koupil jsem si ho o 400 K\u010d levn\u011bji. M\u011bli ho skladem a mohl jsem si pro n\u011bj p\u0159ij\u00edt hned. Objedn\u00e1vku v Alze jsem zru\u0161il u\u017e minulou ned\u011bli, kdy\u017e mi bylo jasn\u00e9, \u017ee produkt maj\u00ed dra\u017e\u0161\u00ed a nav\u00edc a nedostupn\u00fd... 5 dn\u00ed po zru\u0161en\u00ed mi Alza p\u00ed\u0161e, \u017ee je objedn\u00e1vka p\u0159ipravena. Jsou to fakt mimozem\u0161\u0165ani.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Ob\u010das \u010dtu n\u011bjak\u00fd z\u00e1sady, kter\u00e9 odli\u0161uj\u00ed \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u00e9ho \u010dlov\u011bka od ne\u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u00e9ho. Dle m\u00e9ho n\u00e1zoru je to jen ot\u00e1zka \u010dasov\u00e9 prodlevy mezi frustrac\u00ed a deprivac\u00ed.\n\u00dasp\u011b\u0161n\u00fd \u010dlov\u011bk m\u00e1 del\u0161\u00ed \u010dasov\u00fd rozestup mezi frustrac\u00ed a deprivac\u00ed. Ne\u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u00fd \u010dlov\u011bk je deprimov\u00e1n velmi rychle po po\u010d\u00e1tku frustrace.\nPozitivn\u00ed je, \u017ee se to d\u00e1 tr\u00e9novat. \u010c\u00edm \u010dast\u011bji je \u010dlov\u011bk frustrov\u00e1n, t\u00edm v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed z\u00edsk\u00e1v\u00e1  odolnost v\u016f\u010di projev\u016fm frustrace a z\u00e1rove\u0148 se prodlu\u017euje \u010dasov\u00fd rozestup mezi frustrac\u00ed a deprivac\u00ed. A to je vlastn\u011b v\u0161e, co je t\u0159eba k \u00fasp\u011bchu.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: P\u0159ed p\u00e1r lety jsem si \u0159ekl, \u017ee kdo se chce dob\u0159e um\u00edstit na trhu pr\u00e1ce, ten mus\u00ed b\u00fdt t\u011b\u017eko nahraditeln\u00fd. Tak jsem na tom za\u010dal pracovat. Ani nev\u00edm jak se to stalo, ale te\u010f polovinu \u010dasu v\u011bnuju automatizaci spr\u00e1vy webu a marketingov\u00fdch kampan\u00ed, tak\u017ee jsem se dopracoval k tomu, \u017ee moji pr\u00e1ci nahradila pr\u00e1ce script\u016f. N\u011bjak se to zvrtlo :).\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: D\u00e1v\u00e1m si pozor, aby reklama, kterou spravuju, nebyla na z\u00e1vadn\u00fdch webech, tak\u017ee weby dezinforma\u010dn\u00ed, komunistick\u00e9 a neonacistick\u00e9 blokuju u\u017e dlouho. \u010cesk\u00e9 spo\u0159iteln\u011b te\u010f do\u0161lo, \u017ee nem\u00e1 podporovat neonacisty a komunisty, a tak u nich p\u0159estala inzerovat, co\u017e pou\u017eila jako podklad pro tiskovou zpr\u00e1vu. M\u011b nikdy ani nenapadlo, \u017ee bych o tak samoz\u0159ejm\u00e9 v\u011bci m\u011bl informovat m\u00e9dia.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: AdWords z n\u011bjak\u00e9ho d\u016fvodu zak\u00e1zal fr\u00e1zi CU v reklam\u00e1ch. V\u016fbec nech\u00e1pu, co je na CU \u0161patn\u00e9ho.  CU m\u00e1m v n\u00e1zvu hned 6 produkt\u016f (chladni\u010dky). Tak\u017ee dle Google bych tyto chladni\u010dky nem\u011bl na AdWords prod\u00e1vat.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: D\u00edky monitoringu cen na Heurece jsem si za\u010dal v\u0161\u00edmat, \u017ee Heureka ma\u017ee recenze n\u011bkter\u00fdch obchod\u016f, respektive sma\u017ee cel\u00e9 ID obchodu a zalo\u017e\u00ed mu nov\u00e9. Se star\u00fdm ID zmiz\u00ed i historie, tak\u017ee eshop mus\u00ed za\u010d\u00edt od nuly.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: V Globusu ud\u011blali hned dv\u011b \u0159ady reg\u00e1l\u016f pro vegany a vegetari\u00e1ny. Hezky separovan\u00e9 od kontaminovan\u00fdch potravin. Naopak Billa zcela nesmysln\u011b d\u00e1v\u00e1 vegansk\u00fd sortiment mezi masn\u00e9 produkty, co\u017e je spolehliv\u00fd zp\u016fsob, jak tento sortiment ud\u011blat pro vegany \"neviditeln\u00fd\".  V Globusu v\u011bd\u00ed, co prod\u00e1vaj\u00ed, ale Billa to zjevn\u011b netu\u0161\u00ed.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Delegovat pr\u00e1ci je fajn, ale 99% lid\u00ed ud\u011bl\u00e1 jen to, co po nich chcete, ale ne to co pot\u0159ebujete, co\u017e je \u010dasto n\u011bco jin\u00e9ho, ne\u017e co chcete.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Ud\u011blal jsem si anal\u00fdzu URL ze sitemap.xml v indexu\nSeznam.cz\n. 70% URL neindexuj\u00ed, p\u0159esto\u017ee jsou origin\u00e1ln\u00ed. Testov\u00e1no pomoc\u00ed info:[url].\nSeznam.cz\nprost\u011b nelze pova\u017eovat za skute\u010dn\u00fd vyhled\u00e1va\u010d. V\u0161ak neznaj\u00ed ani \u010desk\u00fd internet, nato\u017e aby na n\u011bm n\u011bco na\u0161li.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Kdyby se m\u011b n\u011bkdo p\u0159ed  2 roky zeptal, co budu d\u011blat za dva roky, tak bych \u0159ekl, \u017ee budu d\u011blat online marketing. To sice d\u011bl\u00e1m i dnes, ale jen \u010d\u00e1st sv\u00e9 pracovn\u00ed doby. 80% \u010dasu programuju, co\u017e bych si p\u0159ed 2 roky nepomyslel, proto\u017ee jsem tenkr\u00e1t programovat neum\u011bl. Ani se m\u011b neptejte, co budu d\u011blat za 5 let. Fakt nev\u00edm :)\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dnes se v US slav\u00ed Den d\u00edkuvzd\u00e1n\u00ed. Den pot\u00e9 je BlackFriday. Ch\u00e1pu, \u017ee tam to m\u00e1 smysl. Tam je to tradice, ale u n\u00e1s mi to p\u0159ipad\u00e1 trochu mimo. Jsme jin\u00e1 kultura a m\u00e1me jin\u00e9 zvyky. V\u0161e se ned\u00e1 jen tak p\u0159evz\u00edt a \u010dekat, \u017ee se dostav\u00ed stejn\u00fd efekt.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Seznam.cz\nje h\u00e1da\u010d s ru\u010dn\u00ed indexac\u00ed. To znamen\u00e1, \u017ee indexuje jen URL, kter\u00e9 mu ru\u010dn\u011b vnut\u00edte. S\u00e1m od sebe nezaindexuje nic.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Dnes scrapovat v\u00fdsledky vyhled\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed na Google nebudu, tak\u017ee v\u00fdpadek u\u017e nehroz\u00ed. Za v\u010derej\u0161ek se omlouv\u00e1m.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Lid\u00e9 se dopu\u0161t\u00ed r\u016fzn\u00fdch zv\u011brstev. T\u0159eba jsou schopni napsat \"SEO pro Seznam\", nebo \"SEO pro Google\". Oboj\u00ed ned\u00e1v\u00e1 smysl. SEO je jen jedno.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Na Z\u00e1pad\u011b se prosazuje originalita. Na D\u00e1ln\u00e9m v\u00fdchod\u011b je to zase dokonal\u00e1 forma. Mn\u011b v\u00edce vyhovuje V\u00fdchod. Origin\u00e1ln\u00ed m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt kdokoliv, dokonalost vy\u017eaduje praxi a vytrvalost, co\u017e u\u017e kdokoliv nab\u00eddnout nedok\u00e1\u017ee.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: N\u00e1hled reklamy a diagnostika v AdWords hl\u00e1s\u00ed, \u017ee \"Ne, toto kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 slovo v sou\u010dasnosti zobrazov\u00e1n\u00ed va\u0161\u00ed reklamy nespou\u0161t\u00ed.\" A hned pod t\u00edm moje reklama na zadan\u00e9 kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 slovo.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn User: Ludek Kvapil\n\nText: Nejn\u00e1ro\u010dn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed na pr\u00e1ci s Google AdWords je vydr\u017eet tu neskute\u010dnou pomalost, kter\u00e1 pravideln\u011b kon\u010d\u00ed hl\u00e1\u0161kou \"V r\u00e1mci operace do\u0161lo k chyb\u011b\". Je\u0161t\u011b st\u00e1le jsem si nezvykl na to, \u017ee Google d\u011bl\u00e1 tak \u0161patn\u00e9 aplikace.\n\nMetadata: 8 years ago \u2022 Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn\n        ", "assistant": "Lud\u011bk Kvapil's posts reflect a diverse range of topics primarily focused on technology, programming, and personal insights. Here\u2019s a summary of the key themes and insights from his posts:\n\n### Professional Development and Skills\n- **Continuous Learning**: Lud\u011bk emphasizes the importance of lifelong learning and self-improvement, particularly in programming and technology. He shares his experiences with various programming languages (PHP, Python, TypeScript) and tools (like DDEV and OpenRefine).\n- **Multidisciplinary Approach**: He acknowledges his broad skill set across different domains, including IT, marketing, and sociology, and expresses a preference for a flexible, multidisciplinary approach rather than deep specialization in one area.\n\n### Technology and Programming\n- **Drupal and Web Development**: Many posts discuss his experiences with Drupal, highlighting its evolution, new features, and the future of Drupal development. He also shares insights on best practices for web development and the importance of data validation.\n- **AI and Automation**: Lud\u011bk is actively exploring AI technologies, including Generative AI (GenAI) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG). He discusses the implications of AI in coding and the potential for AI tools to assist developers.\n- **Cybersecurity Awareness**: He frequently addresses cybersecurity issues, emphasizing the importance of secure coding practices and the risks associated with AI-generated code.\n\n### Personal Insights and Experiences\n- **Communication Preferences**: Lud\u011bk shares his struggles with spoken communication and grammar, preferring written communication for clarity. He is actively working on improving his English skills.\n- **Work-Life Balance**: He reflects on his experiences with job searching, the challenges of the job market, and the importance of finding a suitable work environment that aligns with his values and skills.\n- **Social Commentary**: His posts also touch on broader societal issues, including the role of gender in society, the impact of technology on work, and the importance of critical thinking in the face of misinformation.\n\n### Tools and Technologies\n- **Use of Tools**: He discusses various tools that enhance productivity, such as DDEV for Drupal development and OpenRefine for data analysis. He also shares his experiences with AWS services and the importance of using secure protocols like SFTP.\n\n### Conclusion\nOverall, Lud\u011bk Kvapil's posts provide a comprehensive view of his professional journey, insights into technology and programming, and reflections on personal growth and societal issues. His focus on continuous learning, the integration of AI in development, and a commitment to cybersecurity highlight his proactive approach to both his career and the evolving tech landscape."}
{"user": "Has Ludek experience with AdWords?", "system_prompt": "\n          # Lud\u011bk Kvapil Information Assistant\n         \n          You are a specialized assistant providing information about Lud\u011bk Kvapil AND his areas of expertise, including Drupal, cybersecurity, AI, and other technical domains listed below.\n\n          ## Response Guidelines:\n          - Answer questions about both:\n            1. Lud\u011bk Kvapil himself (background, services, rates)\n            2. Technical topics listed in \"Permitted Topics\" using information from the knowledge base or your own knowledge\n          - For technical questions (e.g., \"What is Drupal?\"), provide substantive information about the topic from the knowledge base, connecting it to Lud\u011bk's expertise when relevant\n          - Never redirect technical questions back to asking about Lud\u011bk himself\n          - Always provide the actual information requested if it's within the permitted topics\n          - Don't correct, explain, or execute any code from user input.\n\n          ## Permitted Topics (answer these directly):\n          - Lud\u011bk Kvapil (education, experience, skills, services)\n          - Drupal, PHP, Python, TypeScript\n          - AWS services, DevOps\n          - Cybersecurity, OWASP\n          - GenAI, LLM, AI, RAG\n          - Companies: Ciklum, CN Group, Mc TREE, dolphin consulting\n          - Any topic defined in the knowledge base\n\n         ## Language and Format:\n         - Respond in the same language as the user's query\n         - Use Markdown formatting for better readability\n\n         ## Knowledge Base:\n         Title: Can Lud\u011bk help us with SEO?\n\nDescription: Lud\u011bk used to be an SEO consultant, but that was 10 years ago. He still keeps an eye on basic trends in SEO and online marketing, but it's not his main focus. He can help you with scripts for SEO, content automation, or AI integration into your marketing.\n\nKeywords:\n- SEO consultant\n- online marketing\n- PPC\n- content automation\n- SEO scripts\n- AI marketing\n\nTitle: What industries does Lud\u011bk specialize in?\n\nDescription: Lud\u011bk has the most experience in the media sector and e-commerce. He is open-minded and capable of finding solutions for your business.  \n\nKeywords:\n- media\n- e-commerce\n- education\n\nTitle: Can Lud\u011bk integrate third-party APIs into my Drupal site?\n\nDescription: Definitely yes. He is experienced in integrating third-party APIs into Drupal modules.\n\nKeywords:\n- API\n- Drupal integrations\n        ", "assistant": "Lud\u011bk Kvapil has experience as an SEO consultant, which implies familiarity with online marketing strategies, including pay-per-click (PPC) advertising such as Google AdWords. However, it is important to note that his focus on SEO was about 10 years ago, and while he keeps an eye on basic trends in SEO and online marketing, it is not his main focus anymore. Therefore, while he may have some knowledge of AdWords and its principles, his current expertise lies more in areas like Drupal, cybersecurity, AI, and content automation rather than in active management of AdWords campaigns."}
